Notebook[{
Cell["\<\
Handing NDSolve a regularized Stratonovich equation: the state and readout of \
a monitored qubit\
\>", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"22a1a762-10e3-861e-525e-3f4ca097ed64"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["This document shows how to simulate a continuously monitored qubit \
with ",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 Cell[BoxData["NDSolve"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,
  FontWeight->"Bold",ExpressionUUID->"4da796ef-9f57-a4bf-7b5c-0fc91ae30e85"],
 StyleBox[". We have implemented this approach for a model that follows four \
quantities: three numbers that describe the qubit state (i.e., the components \
of the Bloch vector) and the detector's accumulated readout. The dynamical \
equations for these four quantities are usually written as a nonlinear \
stochastic differential equation in It\[OHat] form. The obstacle is that ",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 Cell[BoxData["NDSolve"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,
  FontWeight->"Bold",ExpressionUUID->"1b39f900-6440-cee7-4ac6-f16a0dfa94cd"],
 StyleBox[" cannot use noise as an ordinary function of time\[LongDash]or, \
more generally, any variable that must be sampled from a distribution. \
Following the essence of the Wong\[Dash]Zakai theorem, we therefore convert \
the original It\[OHat] equation to its equivalent Stratonovich form, which is \
suited to smooth approximations of the noise, and replace the rough Wiener \
path with a continuous piecewise-cubic path. ",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 Cell[BoxData["NDSolve"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,
  FontWeight->"Bold",ExpressionUUID->"75d93363-5da6-51a4-23e6-ab4d5453238e"],
 StyleBox[" can then solve the resulting random ordinary differential \
equation. As the noise grid is refined, this regularized equation approaches \
the original stochastic model under the conditions of the Wong\[Dash]Zakai \
theorem. Symbolic checks recover the standard master-equation evolution \
exactly, while finite-sample simulations compare the mean and spread with \
independent references. These numerical comparisons support the method but do \
not by themselves prove convergence.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"]
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"25a568a6-87a2-527f-535a-810032572145"],

Cell["Mads Bahrami (last updated: August 12, 2026)", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"00d7f70d-8d0e-ae34-30ec-ef5724b8f51e"],

Cell["\<\
The trajectory equations: the state and the readout in one SDE\
\>", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"2f3e8453-9762-68ea-56c5-1e1d22173a30"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A continuously monitored quantum state can be understood schematically as \
",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["c", "TI"]], "=", "\[ScriptCapitalL]", 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["c", "TI"]], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], " ", 
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["t", "TI"], "+", "\[ScriptCapitalM]", 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["c", "TI"]], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], " ", 
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["W", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5902d484-617f-9570-0f31-cdee100bfc5a"],
 ": the drift ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\[ScriptCapitalL]", 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["c", "TI"]], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], " ", 
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["t", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "56e0e12c-de7d-6135-7e9f-f889db08301f"],
 " describes deterministic Hamiltonian evolution, relaxation, dephasing, and \
the unconditional disturbance caused by measurement, while ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\[ScriptCapitalM]", 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["c", "TI"]], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], " ", 
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["W", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5708d032-2150-04f2-7d37-ca7c50e56ed8"],
 " is the stochastic, record-dependent measurement update. The detector \
record obeys ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["Q", "TI"], "=", 
   StyleBox["s", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["c", "TI"]], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], " ", 
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["t", "TI"], "+", 
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["W", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3b7807e8-9504-b25a-6907-9eb21cb600a0"],
 ", where ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["s", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["c", "TI"]], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "166f8969-5e31-e8e5-3e14-21335bc5bacf"],
 " is the expected signal, so ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["W", "TI"], "=", 
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["Q", "TI"], "-", 
   StyleBox["s", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["c", "TI"]], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], " ", 
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["t", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "234f1fb7-07c6-bba9-5174-96f1b27009f3"],
 " is the innovation\[LongDash]the unpredictable part of the observed result\
\[LongDash]and the same Wiener increment updates both the record and the \
state. Because the stochastic average ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\|01d53c", 
   StyleBox["[",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{"d", "W"}], "TI"], 
   StyleBox["]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "=", "0"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6ee45b93-a0df-d1f6-169c-52dcd16ba3dc"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["W", "TI"], "2"], "=", 
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["t", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0a3edd72-e0d3-62fb-3bc5-d53f916630c1"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox[
   RowBox[{"d", "W"}], "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6ec9a758-58be-624c-16f6-3f02594b3096"],
 " is of order ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SqrtBox[
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{"d", "t"}], "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "23253b8d-1c99-a6bf-52da-b2d7952d0c85"],
 "; thus ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["c", "TI"]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6e84829b-9667-6594-16bb-1bc523124ffe"],
 " is not an ordinary time derivative but a deterministic prediction plus a \
random correction conditioned on what the detector reports. Averaging over \
all possible records removes the stochastic term and recovers the master \
equation."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"569e173f-6b36-b240-7ea5-8f790ec000aa"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Continuous homodyne monitoring of a driven qubit produces two coupled \
equations driven by the same noise: one for the observer's running estimate \
of the Bloch vector ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    StyleBox["x", "TI"]}], ",", 
   StyleBox["y", "TI"], ",", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["z", "TI"], "}", "=", "{", 
    StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], "^"], 
     StyleBox["x", "TI"]], 
    StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
     SpanMaxSize->1]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], "^"], 
     StyleBox["y", "TI"]], 
    StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
     SpanMaxSize->1]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], "^"], 
     StyleBox["z", "TI"]], 
    StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
     SpanMaxSize->1], "}"}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "15a3e88e-0b57-fa6e-4350-01e8aee3c8b4"],
 ", in the convention ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox[
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], "^"], 
    StyleBox["z", "TI"]], "=", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     TemplateBox[{
       StyleBox["g", "TI"]},
      "Ket"], 
     TemplateBox[{
       StyleBox["g", "TI"]},
      "Bra"]}], "-", 
    RowBox[{
     TemplateBox[{
       StyleBox["e", "TI"]},
      "Ket"], 
     TemplateBox[{
       StyleBox["e", "TI"]},
      "Bra"]}]}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "779c57de-bb93-d239-1da4-4e983e27a103"],
 " that puts the ground state at ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["z", "TI"], "=", "+", "1"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2867ea9b-6e8d-517b-581c-03c50b382041"],
 " (some literature uses the opposite sign), and one for the readout ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["Q", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "76dfbc62-92ac-7b6e-1ee4-364c275949b4"],
 " the detector accumulates while measuring ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox[
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], "^"], 
   StyleBox["z", "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0df4b6a5-173c-e15a-3b8b-2f0fa2ceb3a0"],
 ". Stacking the readout as a fourth component, the pair is a single \
scalar-noise It\[OHat] stochastic differential equation, a drift ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  OverscriptBox[
   StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4d620fc7-5cf2-d9d8-7b11-a6a15484ab22"],
 " times ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox[
   RowBox[{"d", "t"}], "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "741b091d-feb2-1a39-1c38-a146fb476903"],
 " plus a diffusion ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  OverscriptBox[
   StyleBox["b", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3bf5a20e-c541-e06e-698a-446becf5b2b4"],
 " times one Wiener increment ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox[
   RowBox[{"d", "W"}], "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "07964fa7-8d1e-ff14-2dae-660124a8c27e"],
 ":"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3e367b18-9aa8-58f9-67ce-73421f5d2ac3"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["d", "TI"], "(", GridBox[{
      {
       StyleBox["x", "TI"]},
      {
       StyleBox["y", "TI"]},
      {
       StyleBox["z", "TI"]},
      {
       StyleBox["Q", "TI"]}
     }], ")", "=", 
    UnderscriptBox[
     UnderscriptBox[
      RowBox[{"(", GridBox[{
         {
          RowBox[{"-", 
           SubsuperscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", "2", 
            StyleBox["eff",
             FontSlant->"Plain"]], " ", 
           StyleBox["x", "TI"]}]},
         {
          RowBox[{"-", 
           SubsuperscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", "2", 
            StyleBox["eff",
             FontSlant->"Plain"]], " ", 
           StyleBox["y", "TI"], "-", 
           SubscriptBox["\[CapitalOmega]", 
            StyleBox["x", "TI"]], " ", 
           StyleBox["z", "TI"]}]},
         {
          RowBox[{
           SubscriptBox[
            StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], "1"], 
           StyleBox["(",
            SpanMaxSize->1], 
           RowBox[{"1", "-", 
            StyleBox["z", "TI"]}], 
           StyleBox[")",
            SpanMaxSize->1], "+", 
           SubscriptBox["\[CapitalOmega]", 
            StyleBox["x", "TI"]], " ", 
           StyleBox["y", "TI"]}]},
         {
          RowBox[{
           SqrtBox[
            SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
             StyleBox[
              RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], " ", 
           StyleBox["z", "TI"]}]}
        }], ")"}], "\[UnderBrace]"], 
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"]], " ", 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["t", "TI"], "\[ThickSpace]", "+", "\[ThickSpace]", 
    UnderscriptBox[
     UnderscriptBox[
      RowBox[{"(", GridBox[{
         {
          RowBox[{"-", 
           SqrtBox[
            SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
             StyleBox[
              RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], " ", 
           StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
           StyleBox["z", "TI"], "-", 
           SqrtBox[
            SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
             StyleBox[
              RowBox[{"B", "A"}], "TI"]]], " ", 
           StyleBox["y", "TI"]}]},
         {
          RowBox[{"-", 
           SqrtBox[
            SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
             StyleBox[
              RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], " ", 
           StyleBox["y", "TI"], 
           StyleBox["z", "TI"], "+", 
           SqrtBox[
            SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
             StyleBox[
              RowBox[{"B", "A"}], "TI"]]], " ", 
           StyleBox["x", "TI"]}]},
         {
          RowBox[{
           SqrtBox[
            SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
             StyleBox[
              RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], " ", 
           StyleBox["(",
            SpanMaxSize->1], 
           RowBox[{"1", "-", 
            SuperscriptBox[
             StyleBox["z", "TI"], "2"]}], 
           StyleBox[")",
            SpanMaxSize->1]}]},
         {"1"}
        }], ")"}], "\[UnderBrace]"], 
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["b", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"]], " ", 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["W", "TI"]}], "."}],
  Alignment->Center,
  ImageSize->Full]], "DisplayFormula",ExpressionUUID->"1dbaaaf7-1388-e538-4b59-43b1a622cc02"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "This is the target: the process whose mean we will check against the \
Lindblad master equation and whose spread we will check against a native \
integrator. The top three rows, the Bloch state, close on their own, nothing \
in them depends on ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["Q", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "77d99fdb-a351-2d53-1de6-1684d6e477b9"],
 "; the fourth row is the record, an integral whose drift ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SqrtBox[
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], " ", 
   StyleBox["z", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "04646437-faee-7dfc-2c1c-7e70fe9b47c6"],
 " carries the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox[
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], "^"], 
   StyleBox["z", "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1cbde497-e826-5557-4442-fdd089d33fbd"],
 " signal and whose noise is the same ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox[
   RowBox[{"d", "W"}], "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6ecb37d0-fbcc-3e82-16c8-ae9dfe7e84e8"],
 " that kicks the state."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4c358d3e-86d3-ec5f-75ca-25783367b6a5"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The six parameters have units of inverse time: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1f908cf3-3c70-d55a-45af-25bdb50abfa0"],
 " is the informative (coherent-information) rate, which sharpens the \
conditional state toward a ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox[
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], "^"], 
   StyleBox["z", "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5dac66ba-272d-3627-0b54-7fe452d99d0d"],
 " eigenstate; ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{"B", "A"}], "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "110914de-bbdd-83a1-4736-8d983e69d18b"],
 " is the backaction rate of the orthogonal homodyne quadrature, which \
rotates the transverse phase; ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
   StyleBox["d", "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "76d004f9-29e5-6665-1eef-9da34f904d4f"],
 " is the measurement-induced ensemble dephasing; ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox[
   StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2c76c797-c249-79ca-540d-ded0f7fc4b10"],
 " is intrinsic pure dephasing; ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], "1"], "=", "1", "/", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["T", "TI"], "1"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "35077f55-9291-6519-633d-771f27244c63"],
 " is relaxation; and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox["\[CapitalOmega]", 
   StyleBox["x", "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4ebf3687-f906-130d-7644-afe0f8b37e57"],
 " is the Rabi frequency. One combination recurs, the effective transverse \
decay ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", "2", 
    StyleBox["eff",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], "=", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], "1"], "/", "2", "+", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]], "+", 
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "65de4a87-3471-cd9f-13e6-63e1bd0597e5"],
 ". When ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"]], ">", "0"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7bedd9bd-1d84-ddaa-2992-d0e79436a7f0"],
 ", the detector efficiency is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"], "=", 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]], "+", 
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"B", "A"}], "TI"]]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "/", 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{"2", 
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox["d", "TI"]]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4c37f35a-e1a6-07fe-75cc-eb0790536dc4"],
 ", with a quantum-limited detector satisfying ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"0", "\[LessEqual]", 
   StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"], "\[LessEqual]", "1"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "02f88238-86c8-66df-3287-2462337d4c25"],
 ". The benchmark ensembles below use ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"], "=", "1"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "034d641c-5834-e412-3173-7e4659c6cf78"],
 "; one deliberately unphysical example violates the admissibility condition. \
Numerically, time and all rates are nondimensionalized by a chosen reference \
rate (the representative example takes that reference to be ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox[
   StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], "1"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "52ce4f6a-032d-a48b-02f6-6734b6d90ed1"],
 "). Throughout, the code takes a rate vector ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["r", "TI"], "=", "{", 
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]}], ",", 
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
    StyleBox[
     RowBox[{"B", "A"}], "TI"]], ",", 
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"]], ",", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]], ",", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], "1"], ",", 
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalOmega]", 
     StyleBox["x", "TI"]], "}"}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5bfe104a-50de-a555-0985-8a1461680fbf"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"134534fb-1061-d656-417a-ada5a115bcbc"],

Cell["\<\
For a single scalar noise, the It\[OHat] equation above is identical to a \
Stratonovich equation with the same diffusion and a drift lowered by one \
exact term (the It\[OHat]-Stratonovich conversion).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2cd98fd2-34e7-e188-54e6-269cbc93b3d2"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["d", "TI"], "(", GridBox[{
      {
       StyleBox["x", "TI"]},
      {
       StyleBox["y", "TI"]},
      {
       StyleBox["z", "TI"]},
      {
       StyleBox["Q", "TI"]}
     }], ")", "=", "(", GridBox[{
      {
       RowBox[{
        StyleBox["(",
         FontSize->1.2 Inherited], 
        FractionBox[
         RowBox[{
          SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
           StyleBox[
            RowBox[{"B", "A"}], "TI"]], "+", 
          SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
           StyleBox[
            RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]}], "2"], "-", 
        SubsuperscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", "2", 
         StyleBox["eff",
          FontSlant->"Plain"]], "-", 
        SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
         StyleBox[
          RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]], " ", 
        SuperscriptBox[
         StyleBox["z", "TI"], "2"], 
        StyleBox[")",
         FontSize->1.2 Inherited], " ", 
        StyleBox["x", "TI"], "-", 
        SqrtBox[
         RowBox[{
          SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
           StyleBox[
            RowBox[{"B", "A"}], "TI"]], 
          SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
           StyleBox[
            RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]}]], " ", 
        StyleBox["y", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["z", "TI"]}]},
      {
       RowBox[{
        StyleBox["(",
         FontSize->1.2 Inherited], 
        FractionBox[
         RowBox[{
          SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
           StyleBox[
            RowBox[{"B", "A"}], "TI"]], "+", 
          SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
           StyleBox[
            RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]}], "2"], "-", 
        SubsuperscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", "2", 
         StyleBox["eff",
          FontSlant->"Plain"]], "-", 
        SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
         StyleBox[
          RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]], " ", 
        SuperscriptBox[
         StyleBox["z", "TI"], "2"], 
        StyleBox[")",
         FontSize->1.2 Inherited], " ", 
        StyleBox["y", "TI"], "+", 
        SqrtBox[
         RowBox[{
          SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
           StyleBox[
            RowBox[{"B", "A"}], "TI"]], 
          SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
           StyleBox[
            RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]}]], " ", 
        StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["z", "TI"], "-", 
        SubscriptBox["\[CapitalOmega]", 
         StyleBox["x", "TI"]], " ", 
        StyleBox["z", "TI"]}]},
      {
       RowBox[{
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], "1"], 
        StyleBox["(",
         SpanMaxSize->1], 
        RowBox[{"1", "-", 
         StyleBox["z", "TI"]}], 
        StyleBox[")",
         SpanMaxSize->1], "+", 
        SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
         StyleBox[
          RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]], " ", 
        StyleBox["z", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["(",
         SpanMaxSize->1], 
        RowBox[{"1", "-", 
         SuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["z", "TI"], "2"]}], 
        StyleBox[")",
         SpanMaxSize->1], "+", 
        SubscriptBox["\[CapitalOmega]", 
         StyleBox["x", "TI"]], " ", 
        StyleBox["y", "TI"]}]},
      {
       RowBox[{
        SqrtBox[
         SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
          StyleBox[
           RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], " ", 
        StyleBox["z", "TI"]}]}
     }], ")", 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["t", "TI"], "\[ThickSpace]", "+", "\[ThickSpace]", "(", 
    GridBox[{
      {
       RowBox[{"-", 
        SqrtBox[
         SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
          StyleBox[
           RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], " ", 
        StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["z", "TI"], "-", 
        SqrtBox[
         SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
          StyleBox[
           RowBox[{"B", "A"}], "TI"]]], " ", 
        StyleBox["y", "TI"]}]},
      {
       RowBox[{"-", 
        SqrtBox[
         SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
          StyleBox[
           RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], " ", 
        StyleBox["y", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["z", "TI"], "+", 
        SqrtBox[
         SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
          StyleBox[
           RowBox[{"B", "A"}], "TI"]]], " ", 
        StyleBox["x", "TI"]}]},
      {
       RowBox[{
        SqrtBox[
         SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
          StyleBox[
           RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], " ", 
        StyleBox["(",
         SpanMaxSize->1], 
        RowBox[{"1", "-", 
         SuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["z", "TI"], "2"]}], 
        StyleBox[")",
         SpanMaxSize->1]}]},
      {"1"}
     }], ")", "\[SmallCircle]", 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["W", "TI"]}], "."}],
  Alignment->Center,
  ImageSize->Full]], "DisplayFormula",ExpressionUUID->"6e1c99a5-dcef-9c28-1623-100ed49be772"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "We feed the Stratonovich form to the random ODE because continuous, \
piecewise-smooth approximations of a one-dimensional Wiener path converge \
under the usual ",
 ButtonBox["Wong-Zakai hypotheses",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->{
    URL["https://arxiv.org/abs/1403.7281"], None}],
 " to the Stratonovich solution. The fact that the driving noise is scalar \
matters: with several noncommuting noise channels, the limiting equation can \
depend on how the missing iterated integrals are approximated. At any nonzero \
grid spacing the ODE is only a regularized model; the equality with the \
target SDE is a limit statement, not an identity at finite resolution. The \
readout row is the same in both calculi because its diffusion coefficient is \
the constant one, so its conversion correction vanishes. After \
nondimensionalizing time, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["Q", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "608e87cc-8fce-afdf-10b5-1e962a78f525"],
 " is dimensionless; before nondimensionalization it carries the same units \
as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["W", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2aa912c6-4938-1bb7-5a56-8ba068cd699d"],
 ", namely ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SqrtBox[
   StyleBox["time",
    FontSlant->"Plain"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "66b4bee0-d247-b105-0e4b-37cde7f3006f"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"337c2d89-644e-5b5e-6103-c4d30dfb29a4"],

Cell["Encoding the Stratonovich vector field", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"5f7c2741-1c81-ec9b-0503-bf2b9535b6e1"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Encode the Stratonovich drift, all four rows and name the entries of the \
rate vector ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["r", "TI"], "=", "{", 
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]}], ",", 
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
    StyleBox[
     RowBox[{"B", "A"}], "TI"]], ",", 
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"]], ",", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]], ",", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], "1"], ",", 
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalOmega]", 
     StyleBox["x", "TI"]], "}"}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "644cc522-c7c4-9b18-0c73-dc8ff276e662"],
 ":"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2de8c8f9-eaf3-8e90-5b97-e1a28e87d4fa"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "driftStrat", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"driftStrat", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"x_", ",", " ", "y_", ",", " ", "z_", ",", " ", "q_"}], "}"}], ",",
      " ", "r_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", "\n", "  ", 
   RowBox[{"With", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"\[CapitalGamma]CI", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"r", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\[CapitalGamma]BA", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"r", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\[CapitalGamma]d", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"r", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
       RowBox[{"\[Gamma]\[Phi]", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"r", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "4", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\[Gamma]1", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"r", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "5", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\[CapitalOmega]x", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"r", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "6", "]"}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"With", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"\[CapitalGamma]2", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"\[Gamma]1", "/", "2"}], " ", "+", " ", "\[Gamma]\[Phi]", 
          " ", "+", " ", "\[CapitalGamma]d"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"(", 
               RowBox[{
               "\[CapitalGamma]BA", " ", "+", " ", "\[CapitalGamma]CI"}], 
               ")"}], "/", "2"}], " ", "-", " ", "\[CapitalGamma]2", " ", "-",
              " ", 
             RowBox[{"\[CapitalGamma]CI", " ", 
              RowBox[{"z", "^", "2"}]}]}], ")"}], " ", "x"}], " ", "-", " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
            RowBox[{"\[CapitalGamma]BA", " ", "\[CapitalGamma]CI"}], "]"}], " ",
            "y", " ", "z"}]}], ",", "\n", "     ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"(", 
               RowBox[{
               "\[CapitalGamma]BA", " ", "+", " ", "\[CapitalGamma]CI"}], 
               ")"}], "/", "2"}], " ", "-", " ", "\[CapitalGamma]2", " ", "-",
              " ", 
             RowBox[{"\[CapitalGamma]CI", " ", 
              RowBox[{"z", "^", "2"}]}]}], ")"}], " ", "y"}], " ", "+", " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
            RowBox[{"\[CapitalGamma]BA", " ", "\[CapitalGamma]CI"}], "]"}], " ",
            "x", " ", "z"}], " ", "-", " ", 
          RowBox[{"\[CapitalOmega]x", " ", "z"}]}], ",", "\n", "     ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"\[Gamma]1", " ", 
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"1", " ", "-", " ", "z"}], ")"}]}], " ", "+", " ", 
          RowBox[{"\[CapitalGamma]CI", " ", "z", " ", 
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"1", " ", "-", " ", 
             RowBox[{"z", "^", "2"}]}], ")"}]}], " ", "+", " ", 
          RowBox[{"\[CapitalOmega]x", " ", "y"}]}], ",", "\n", "     ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "\[CapitalGamma]CI", "]"}], " ", "z"}]}], 
        "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[1]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"6801f052-da94-0b6f-183e-ea1fdf2159b5"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Encode the Stratonovich diffusion, the same ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  OverscriptBox[
   StyleBox["b", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0daf8e98-7628-e40b-3b54-27c203c2cf51"],
 " as the It\[OHat] form:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7b6211f5-475c-1194-2911-88bf72e963fe"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "diffStrat", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"diffStrat", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"x_", ",", " ", "y_", ",", " ", "z_", ",", " ", "q_"}], "}"}], ",",
      " ", "r_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", "\n", "  ", 
   RowBox[{"With", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"\[CapitalGamma]CI", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"r", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\[CapitalGamma]BA", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"r", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"-", 
          RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "\[CapitalGamma]CI", "]"}]}], " ", "x", " ", 
         "z"}], " ", "-", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "\[CapitalGamma]BA", "]"}], " ", "y"}]}], ",", 
       "\n", "    ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"-", 
          RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "\[CapitalGamma]CI", "]"}]}], " ", "y", " ", 
         "z"}], " ", "+", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "\[CapitalGamma]BA", "]"}], " ", "x"}]}], ",", 
       "\n", "    ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "\[CapitalGamma]CI", "]"}], " ", 
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"1", " ", "-", " ", 
          RowBox[{"z", "^", "2"}]}], ")"}]}], ",", "\n", "    ", "1"}], 
      "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[2]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"7c8f7bdf-2493-8d8a-24b5-72994d27d7d0"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "To read these back as formulas, write the six rates as symbols, using \
string subscripts so the labels stay ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
    StyleBox[
     RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]], ",", 
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
    StyleBox[
     RowBox[{"B", "A"}], "TI"]], ",", "\[Ellipsis]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "14e8dcaf-74c9-37ba-3c97-d5097d7d9d80"],
 " and never collide with the Bloch ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["x", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5d5cbd3a-e88d-ee42-0b63-35678939b4a8"],
 " or fuse into a ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["C", "TI"], "\[CenterDot]", 
   StyleBox["I", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3b7fe4cc-5889-7f4e-6904-fd96593c4594"],
 " product. The readbacks and the symbolic conversion below use ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["x", "TI"], ",", 
   StyleBox["y", "TI"], ",", 
   StyleBox["z", "TI"], ",", 
   StyleBox["q", "TI"], ",", 
   StyleBox["Q", "TI"], ",", 
   StyleBox["t", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6cb5c01f-62f5-68e0-144a-da5916803aca"],
 ", a formal noise ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["w", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "55f417ec-7166-d78d-038b-8eb60010bdd7"],
 ", the starting values, and the rate symbols themselves as unassigned \
variables, so clear them first:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4b6e5dad-9702-0c1f-7916-54f722b75765"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", 
   RowBox[{
   "x", ",", " ", "y", ",", " ", "z", ",", " ", "q", ",", " ", "Q", ",", " ", 
    "t", ",", " ", "w", ",", " ", "x0", ",", " ", "y0", ",", " ", "z0", ",", 
    " ", "q0", ",", " ", "\[CapitalGamma]", ",", " ", "\[Gamma]", ",", " ", 
    "\[CapitalOmega]"}], "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ratesSym", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Subscript", "[", 
      RowBox[{"\[CapitalGamma]", ",", " ", "\"\<CI\>\""}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Subscript", "[", 
      RowBox[{"\[CapitalGamma]", ",", " ", "\"\<BA\>\""}], "]"}], ",", "\n", 
     "   ", 
     RowBox[{"Subscript", "[", 
      RowBox[{"\[CapitalGamma]", ",", " ", "\"\<d\>\""}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Subscript", "[", 
      RowBox[{"\[Gamma]", ",", " ", "\"\<\[Phi]\>\""}], "]"}], ",", "\n", 
     "   ", 
     RowBox[{"Subscript", "[", 
      RowBox[{"\[Gamma]", ",", " ", "\"\<1\>\""}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Subscript", "[", 
      RowBox[{"\[CapitalOmega]", ",", " ", "\"\<x\>\""}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}], 
  ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[3]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"1d359769-845f-cd94-44ca-0f332deb97fe"],

Cell["\<\
Verify that the encoded drift is the Stratonovich drift written above, by \
reading it back on the symbolic rates:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2055bfee-d4b5-7aa2-506a-36cbdd404888"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"driftStrat", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"x", ",", " ", "y", ",", " ", "z", ",", " ", "Q"}], "}"}], ",", 
    " ", "ratesSym"}], "]"}], " ", "//", " ", "MatrixForm"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[4]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"64c30c0d-1857-1b13-0cf0-a65799e26679"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "As one can see, the four rows are term for term the drift in the display \
equation, with Wolfram ordering each sum its own way: the state rows carry \
the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"-", 
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
    StyleBox[
     RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]], 
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["z", "TI"], "2"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "46632a09-cc5f-b0ef-6e10-cc52e5eb0235"],
 " sharpening and the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SqrtBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"B", "A"}], "TI"]], 
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]}]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6ea251ed-865f-e03c-1652-48b733ebb306"],
 " cross term, and the readout row is the bare ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SqrtBox[
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], " ", 
   StyleBox["z", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "25a0bfbe-b1d4-2428-535f-36fbc0668f72"],
 " signal. Confirm the diffusion the same way:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"04786d0e-016a-d127-2c07-8568b01ca00d"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"diffStrat", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"x", ",", " ", "y", ",", " ", "z", ",", " ", "Q"}], "}"}], ",", 
    " ", "ratesSym"}], "]"}], " ", "//", " ", "MatrixForm"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[5]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"2d15b43a-cd49-5244-5b2a-2e67e4fc20ae"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "As expected, the three state rows are ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  OverscriptBox[
   StyleBox["b", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2d1ff276-b82a-c3ca-5b24-f43039dc9110"],
 " and the readout row is the constant one, the additive noise that makes ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["Q", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "14fd1512-f616-8834-3c82-8d5f83a0db1e"],
 " the same in both stochastic calculi. The code and the equations are one \
object, so from here on we compute with the code."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"66c67103-72a1-9427-0efe-696d0755ff0d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Fix a representative normalized benchmark, rescaled by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox[
   StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], "1"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "48c794f4-84f6-2bfc-78fc-0dbe2c8379c6"],
 "; its readout is quantum-limited (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"], "=", "1"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "58ee7ecb-1370-1005-0896-7795a605636f"],
 "), ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
    StyleBox[
     RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]], "+", 
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
    StyleBox[
     RowBox[{"B", "A"}], "TI"]], "=", "2", 
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "11d04a92-cbef-a8a5-47e0-63dfed9bfa8f"],
 " exactly:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7d9821c9-0e61-bc6d-2ba7-b893ab1506b7"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ratesB", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
    "0.252", ",", " ", "0.1", ",", " ", "0.176", ",", " ", "1.", ",", " ", 
     "1.", ",", " ", "3."}], "}"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[6]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"3181a460-bc62-f1ee-67be-3e4a3514c334"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Start from the ground state with the readout zeroed, a four-vector: the \
three Bloch numbers followed by the record ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["Q", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3937e1d4-04c3-e55a-68cc-f89ead77cfa0"],
 ":"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6b45e796-37a7-eecc-197a-fed04253b416"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"initB", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"0.", ",", " ", "0.", ",", " ", "1.", ",", " ", "0."}], "}"}]}], 
  ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[7]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"5e187950-8ca2-2ab2-0638-711a25577898"],

Cell["Fix a short time window and the trajectory count:", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"250a2d7c-9b81-05b0-5309-c5261e346f9a"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"tfB", " ", "=", " ", "3."}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"nB", " ", "=", " ", "600"}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[8]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"15a9104d-5625-6af3-4356-8a1763d038d9"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "For the trajectory to stay a density matrix, the measurement must fit \
inside the total dephasing, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
    StyleBox[
     RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]], "+", 
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
    StyleBox[
     RowBox[{"B", "A"}], "TI"]], "\[LessEqual]", "2", 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox["d", "TI"]], "+", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "58c17d8b-1b7e-6f79-08ff-74d59e0b3243"],
 ", an admissibility condition derived below. For ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"]], ">", "0"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "43821c38-6720-b4f9-71b1-966212da1ec3"],
 " it reads ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"], "\[LessEqual]", "1", "+", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]], "/", 
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "341c54d9-3079-6bba-5c24-4d83410c3980"],
 "; a physical detector with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"], "\[LessEqual]", "1"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1dbf9c2b-d84a-d79b-4b44-1674d9fcbde1"],
 " and nonnegative intrinsic dephasing satisfies it. Confirm this set \
passes:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0f449897-1a0e-51e7-357b-11d19fbb23cd"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"ratesB", "[", 
    RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "+", " ", 
   RowBox[{"ratesB", "[", 
    RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}]}], " ", "<=", " ", 
  RowBox[{"2", " ", 
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"ratesB", "[", 
      RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "+", " ", 
     RowBox[{"ratesB", "[", 
      RowBox[{"[", "4", "]"}], "]"}]}], ")"}]}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[9]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"6d5a63ab-93b9-14f3-1b7a-7af5264c7ed9"],

Cell["\<\
The quantum-limit claim is one division away; define the efficiency and read \
this set's:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5077c06e-c394-b43c-000c-da4bf6261f06"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "efficiency", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"efficiency", "[", "r_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"r", "[", 
       RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "+", " ", 
      RowBox[{"r", "[", 
       RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}]}], ")"}], "/", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"2", " ", 
      RowBox[{"r", "[", 
       RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}]}], ")"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"efficiency", "[", "ratesB", "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[10]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"07359582-e823-44a1-2eca-0cef89d62e8b"],

Cell["\<\
The efficiency is one at the input precision, by construction.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7c239bd0-3ff5-3b18-25d0-129ab9818662"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The reference for the mean is the Lindblad master equation. Because the It\
\[OHat] drift ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  OverscriptBox[
   StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "68c76573-72ce-0c1a-18fd-7d3d077b5760"],
 " is affine in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    StyleBox["x", "TI"]}], ",", 
   StyleBox["y", "TI"], ",", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["z", "TI"], "}"}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6184d2f2-049e-728e-17bb-cbbcad2b40d4"],
 ", the ensemble mean obeys that drift as a closed linear ODE. Encode ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  OverscriptBox[
   StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4fd967ef-5008-0b29-75e7-7ec961bd5673"],
 "'s three state rows once; the symbolic conversion check below must land on \
this same object, so one encoding serves both:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"19bb1c5e-57ab-6e36-4f58-9618625e351c"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "driftIto", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"driftIto", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"x_", ",", " ", "y_", ",", " ", "z_"}], "}"}], ",", " ", "r_"}],
     "]"}], " ", ":=", "\n", "  ", 
   RowBox[{"With", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"\[CapitalGamma]d", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"r", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\[Gamma]\[Phi]", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"r", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "4", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\[Gamma]1", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"r", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "5", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\[CapitalOmega]x", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"r", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "6", "]"}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"With", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"\[CapitalGamma]2", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"\[Gamma]1", "/", "2"}], " ", "+", " ", "\[Gamma]\[Phi]", 
          " ", "+", " ", "\[CapitalGamma]d"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"-", "\[CapitalGamma]2"}], " ", "x"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"-", "\[CapitalGamma]2"}], " ", "y"}], " ", "-", " ", 
          RowBox[{"\[CapitalOmega]x", " ", "z"}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"\[Gamma]1", " ", 
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"1", " ", "-", " ", "z"}], ")"}]}], " ", "+", " ", 
          RowBox[{"\[CapitalOmega]x", " ", "y"}]}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], 
    "]"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[11]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"5c8dcc56-7aa9-964a-04b2-e6107f5dfc90"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Calling that encoding \"the Lindblad master equation\" requires a \
derivation. Build the generator itself, the drive ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["H", "TI"], "=", 
   FractionBox[
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalOmega]", 
     StyleBox["x", "TI"]], "2"], 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["x", "TI"]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "30baa1c8-66ad-75e0-6059-389213585fca"],
 " with relaxation ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], "1"], " ", "\|01d49f", 
   StyleBox["[",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], "-"], 
   StyleBox["]",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "52535901-cb26-8b9c-0261-516aeed0d9e6"],
 " toward the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["z", "TI"], "=", "+", "1"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "323a4b1c-b138-a791-63da-6359c0b20dfb"],
 " ground state and total dephasing ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   FractionBox[
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox[
      StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]], "+", 
     SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
      StyleBox["d", "TI"]]}], "2"], " ", "\|01d49f", 
   StyleBox["[",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["z", "TI"]], 
   StyleBox["]",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7421cf44-a1ac-4319-1dde-e721d0592e63"],
 ", where ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\|01d49f", 
   StyleBox["[",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["L", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], "=", 
   StyleBox["L", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], 
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["L", "TI"], "\[Dagger]"], "-", 
   FractionBox["1", "2"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["L", "TI"], "\[Dagger]"], 
    StyleBox["L", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], "+", 
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["L", "TI"], "\[Dagger]"], 
    StyleBox["L", "TI"]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "511b3347-8d7d-ab60-0738-ab212409f64a"],
 "; project it onto the Pauli components and subtract ",
 Cell[BoxData["driftIto"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "36c19c85-764d-0b01-5efe-15ef03f8566b"],
 ":"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6815cd54-0cd7-196f-182a-e51ea5626bb5"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"With", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"sx", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"PauliMatrix", "[", "1", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"sy", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"PauliMatrix", "[", "2", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"sz", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"PauliMatrix", "[", "3", "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
     RowBox[{"sm", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "0"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"id", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"IdentityMatrix", "[", "2", "]"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"\[Rho]", ",", " ", "diss", ",", " ", "gen"}], "}"}], ",", "\n",
      "  ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"\[Rho]", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"id", " ", "+", " ", 
          RowBox[{"x", " ", "sx"}], " ", "+", " ", 
          RowBox[{"y", " ", "sy"}], " ", "+", " ", 
          RowBox[{"z", " ", "sz"}]}], ")"}], "/", "2"}]}], ";", "\n", "  ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"diss", "[", "L_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"L", " ", ".", " ", "\[Rho]", " ", ".", " ", 
         RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "L", "]"}]}], " ", "-", "\n", 
        "    ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "L", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", "L",
             " ", ".", " ", "\[Rho]"}], " ", "+", " ", 
           RowBox[{"\[Rho]", " ", ".", " ", 
            RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "L", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", 
            "L"}]}], ")"}], "/", "2"}]}]}], ";", "\n", "  ", 
      RowBox[{"gen", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"-", "I"}], " ", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"ratesSym", "[", 
            RowBox[{"[", "6", "]"}], "]"}], "/", "2"}], ")"}], " ", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"sx", " ", ".", " ", "\[Rho]"}], " ", "-", " ", 
           RowBox[{"\[Rho]", " ", ".", " ", "sx"}]}], ")"}]}], " ", "+", "\n",
         "    ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"ratesSym", "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", "5", "]"}], "]"}], " ", 
         RowBox[{"diss", "[", "sm", "]"}]}], " ", "+", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"ratesSym", "[", 
              RowBox[{"[", "4", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "+", " ", 
             RowBox[{"ratesSym", "[", 
              RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}]}], ")"}], "/", "2"}], ")"}], " ", 
         RowBox[{"diss", "[", "sz", "]"}]}]}]}], ";", "\n", "  ", 
      RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Tr", "[", 
            RowBox[{"gen", " ", ".", " ", "#"}], "]"}], " ", "&"}], " ", "/@",
           " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"sx", ",", " ", "sy", ",", " ", "sz"}], "}"}]}], ")"}], 
        " ", "-", " ", 
        RowBox[{"driftIto", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"x", ",", " ", "y", ",", " ", "z"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
          "ratesSym"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[12]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"519775d4-d545-25f2-07ad-6c91dcf18fd8"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Every component cancels, so the affine drift is the Lindblad master \
equation in Bloch coordinates. Relaxation carries ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox[
   StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], "1"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5900aac7-5263-773e-0f3f-43a167165a04"],
 ", while the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox[
   StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["z", "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "06ecfdb3-2197-c9b0-2e93-f4fd50239b9a"],
 " dissipator carries intrinsic and measurement-induced dephasing. Solve that \
affine system with ",
 Cell[BoxData["DSolve"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "12d95fcb-3316-2212-42e7-569546a37178"],
 ", building the equations from ",
 Cell[BoxData["driftIto"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "733995c2-f5bf-78ee-22c6-0caffc4a4a34"],
 " itself so the reference and the checked drift stay one object, and return ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["v", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], 
   StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4f8ab258-7e7f-0723-7589-34027b0a6a09"],
 ":"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6b12ee74-9953-131d-1921-003e18e67e67"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "lindbladBloch", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"lindbladBloch", "[", 
    RowBox[{"r_", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"x0_", ",", " ", "y0_", ",", " ", "z0_"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], " ", 
   ":=", "\n", "  ", 
   RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
      "sol", ",", " ", "xf", ",", " ", "yf", ",", " ", "zf", ",", " ", "t"}], 
      "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"sol", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"DSolve", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"MapThread", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"#1", "'"}], "[", "t", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", "#2"}],
                " ", "&"}], ",", " ", 
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"{", 
                 RowBox[{"xf", ",", " ", "yf", ",", " ", "zf"}], "}"}], ",", 
                " ", 
                RowBox[{"driftIto", "[", 
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"xf", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"yf", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"zf", "[", "t", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", "r"}], 
                 "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", "\n", "       ", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"xf", "[", "0", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", "x0"}], ",", 
              " ", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"yf", "[", "0", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", "y0"}], ",", 
              " ", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"zf", "[", "0", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", "z0"}]}], 
             "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"xf", ",", " ", "yf", ",", " ", "zf"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
          "t"}], "]"}], " ", "//", " ", "First"}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
       RowBox[{"tt", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Re", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"xf", "[", "tt", "]"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"yf", "[", "tt", "]"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"zf", "[", "tt", "]"}]}], "}"}], " ", "/.", " ", "sol"}], 
         "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[13]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"65262d3c-fccc-1dc6-0cdd-c579f579672c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Two numerical scales enter the simulation: the spacing used to sample the \
Wiener path and the integration step chosen by ",
 Cell[BoxData["NDSolve"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5e157ee2-48da-d240-062b-77cc696ca0aa"],
 ". A convenient dimensional estimate includes the drive, longitudinal \
relaxation, transverse decay, and measurement strength. It is only a starting \
mesh heuristic; multiplicative noise supplies no universal accuracy guarantee \
from rates alone."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"78287f93-0f12-7c52-2828-76ddaaa746b8"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "maxRate", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"maxRate", "[", "r_", "]"}], " ", ":=", "\n", "  ", 
   RowBox[{"With", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"\[CapitalGamma]CI", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"r", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\[CapitalGamma]BA", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"r", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\[CapitalGamma]d", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"r", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
       RowBox[{"\[Gamma]\[Phi]", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"r", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "4", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\[Gamma]1", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"r", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "5", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"\[CapitalOmega]x", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"r", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "6", "]"}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Abs", "[", "\[CapitalOmega]x", "]"}], ",", " ", "\[Gamma]1", ",",
        " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"\[Gamma]1", "/", "2"}], " ", "+", " ", "\[Gamma]\[Phi]", " ",
         "+", " ", "\[CapitalGamma]d"}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
       RowBox[{"\[CapitalGamma]CI", " ", "+", " ", "\[CapitalGamma]BA"}]}], 
      "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[14]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"08285353-0e0e-39f8-3828-4b1dabb88bc2"],

Cell["\<\
Use forty target intervals across the shortest estimated timescale as the \
working mesh. This is a reproducible default, not a certified tolerance:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1daed7d3-93e8-7698-4b55-ce9d259d5ce2"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "dtGenOf", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"dtGenOf", "[", "r_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"1", "/", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"40", " ", 
      RowBox[{"maxRate", "[", "r", "]"}]}], ")"}]}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[15]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"187adc3d-3961-76c2-4819-d667b8145c28"],

Cell["Regularizing the noise: a Wiener path NDSolve can integrate", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"641c78eb-7f03-7846-0c24-71b57ab64aac"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A white-noise increment ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox[
   RowBox[{"d", "W"}], "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5bfcc75d-c21d-6fb0-0983-df06f7a8359a"],
 " is not an ordinary function of time, so it cannot simply appear as a \
classical forcing term in ",
 Cell[BoxData["NDSolve"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "112ae6ec-4b5c-6ad2-4729-ffb66ee93838"],
 ". Sample a Wiener path on a grid and interpolate those samples by a \
continuous piecewise-cubic function ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["W", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["h", "TI"]], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6121b9de-dddd-aca8-10de-309bd469f6f2"],
 ". Away from the knots, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["W", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["h", "TI"], "\[Prime]"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "30209679-023a-ee91-61df-0823b7ccb4fb"],
 " is an ordinary polynomial forcing, and"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"29bc1606-c22d-409d-5f43-8863f7d812e7"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["v", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], "=", 
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], 
     StyleBox["Strat",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], " ", 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["t", "TI"], "+", 
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["b", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], "\[SmallCircle]", 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["W", "TI"], "\[NonBreakingSpace]\[NonBreakingSpace]", "\[LongRightArrow]",
     "\[NonBreakingSpace]\[NonBreakingSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      OverscriptBox[
       StyleBox["v", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], "."], 
     StyleBox["h", "TI"]], "=", 
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], 
     StyleBox["Strat",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    StyleBox["(",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["v", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], 
     StyleBox["h", "TI"]], 
    StyleBox[")",
     SpanMaxSize->1], "+", 
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["b", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], 
    StyleBox["(",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["v", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], 
     StyleBox["h", "TI"]], 
    StyleBox[")",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["W", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["h", "TI"], "\[Prime]"], 
    StyleBox["(",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
    StyleBox[")",
     SpanMaxSize->1]}], "."}],
  Alignment->Center,
  ImageSize->Full]], "DisplayFormula",ExpressionUUID->"7bf1e1bf-5b3e-c64b-298e-f8f95ec8ac91"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "For Wolfram Language's ",
 ButtonBox["default order-three interpolation of value data",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->{
    URL["https://reference.wolfram.com/language/ref/Interpolation.html"], 
    None}],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox[
   StyleBox["W", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["h", "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3119d855-3ffd-7401-6726-d21fb9885f6b"],
 " is continuous but its first derivative need not be continuous at a knot. \
Thus the replacement is a piecewise-smooth random ODE, not a globally smooth \
forcing. The forcing changes on the mesh scale ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["h", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "62a6d1b5-4e36-fa69-125d-c8ff6bc0c8b3"],
 "; calling ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["h", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7c41cdc9-5ab3-1ef5-247e-e4935f4664df"],
 " a literal correlation time would be too strong because the interpolated \
derivative is neither stationary nor independent from interval to interval."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"51fce014-dca1-0630-0783-fa51d5546d1a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "One grid carries both the noise and the read-off. The input ",
 Cell[BoxData["dtMax"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "657c1c65-980e-511d-1303-964f19bb2067"],
 " is an upper bound: ",
 Cell[BoxData["Subdivide"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0f15dbd5-5f35-596c-352a-d29f5ac02bb6"],
 " lands exactly on ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox[
   StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["f", "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7e9b7e66-629a-1114-26b9-7040172f607e"],
 ", so the realized spacing can be slightly smaller. At least three intervals \
give the cubic interpolant four points:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"585a51e6-774f-2dd2-087a-48c002fa7738"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", 
   RowBox[{"noiseGrid", ",", " ", "noiseStep"}], "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"noiseGrid", "[", 
    RowBox[{"tf_", ",", " ", "dtMax_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Subdivide", "[", 
    RowBox[{"0.", ",", " ", "tf", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
      RowBox[{"3", ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Ceiling", "[", 
        RowBox[{"tf", "/", "dtMax"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"noiseStep", "[", 
    RowBox[{"tf_", ",", " ", "dtMax_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"tf", "/", 
    RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
     RowBox[{"3", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Ceiling", "[", 
       RowBox[{"tf", "/", "dtMax"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[16]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"1d7c0b5b-c40c-ea6a-4b03-a304edbeb8b0"],

Cell["\<\
On that grid, draw independent Gaussian increments with variance equal to the \
realized spacing, accumulate them, and interpolate the sampled path:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"370294fd-9e49-2d35-5d31-0da71bfc741f"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "wienerFun", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"wienerFun", "[", 
    RowBox[{"tf_", ",", " ", "dtMax_", ",", " ", "seed_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", 
   " ", 
   RowBox[{"BlockRandom", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"SeedRandom", "[", "seed", "]"}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"With", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"grid", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"noiseGrid", "[", 
          RowBox[{"tf", ",", " ", "dtMax"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", 
       "    ", 
       RowBox[{"With", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"incr", " ", "=", " ", 
           RowBox[{"RandomVariate", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"NormalDistribution", "[", 
              RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", 
               RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
                RowBox[{"noiseStep", "[", 
                 RowBox[{"tf", ",", " ", "dtMax"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",",
              " ", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"Length", "[", "grid", "]"}], " ", "-", " ", "1"}]}], 
            "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "     ", 
         RowBox[{"Interpolation", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"grid", ",", " ", 
              RowBox[{"Prepend", "[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"Accumulate", "[", "incr", "]"}], ",", " ", "0."}], 
               "]"}]}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"InterpolationOrder", " ", "->", " ", "3"}]}], "]"}]}], 
        "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[17]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"2845529c-454d-b13b-587b-4bc66cf90001"],

Cell["\<\
Visualize one realization of the path and its piecewise-defined derivative, \
the classical forcing that stands in for white noise:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7519012f-e657-215b-2326-988893e273a1"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"With", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Wf", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"wienerFun", "[", 
       RowBox[{"tfB", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"dtGenOf", "[", "ratesB", "]"}], ",", " ", "11"}], "]"}]}], ",",
      "\n", "  ", 
     RowBox[{"g", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"noiseGrid", "[", 
       RowBox[{"tfB", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"dtGenOf", "[", "ratesB", "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", 
   "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{"With", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"s", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Subdivide", "[", 
        RowBox[{"0.", ",", " ", "tfB", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"2", " ", 
          RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Length", "[", "g", "]"}], " ", "-", " ", "1"}], 
           ")"}]}]}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
     RowBox[{"Row", "[", 
      RowBox[{"{", "\n", "    ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"ListLinePlot", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"s", ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"Wf", "[", "s", "]"}]}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"Frame", " ", "->", " ", "True"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"GridLines", " ", "->", " ", "Automatic"}], ",", "\n", 
          "     ", 
          RowBox[{
          "PlotLabel", " ", "->", 
           " ", "\"\<regularized Wiener path W(t)\>\""}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"FrameLabel", " ", "->", " ", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<t\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<W\>\""}], "}"}]}], ",", "\n", 
          "     ", 
          RowBox[{"ImageSize", " ", "->", " ", "Medium"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
        " ", "\"\<   \>\"", ",", "\n", "    ", 
        RowBox[{"ListLinePlot", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"s", ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"Wf", "'"}], "[", "s", "]"}]}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
          
          RowBox[{"Frame", " ", "->", " ", "True"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"GridLines", " ", "->", " ", "Automatic"}], ",", "\n", 
          "     ", 
          RowBox[{
          "PlotLabel", " ", "->", 
           " ", "\"\<its derivative W'(t): piecewise-smooth noise\>\""}], ",",
           " ", 
          RowBox[{"FrameLabel", " ", "->", " ", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<t\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<W'\>\""}], "}"}]}], ",", "\n",
           "     ", 
          RowBox[{"ImageSize", " ", "->", " ", "Medium"}]}], "]"}]}], "}"}], 
      "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[18]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"594776df-9e75-d16a-0f7d-6f991b01a3b0"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The realized noise spacing ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["h", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6405505f-4b92-3bd6-0c3b-4a196e24893c"],
 " selects the regularized random ODE and controls its bias relative to the \
white-noise limit. ",
 Cell[BoxData["MaxStepSize"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6878c7f8-419e-9db5-1807-dea27028e79f"],
 " controls only the numerical integration of that fixed ODE. Capping it \
below ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["h", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "48a3d607-c312-9dd3-7850-c860f6a4e739"],
 " makes ",
 Cell[BoxData["NDSolve"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "539491e8-328f-8d7b-01ab-08b2473bd441"],
 " resolve each interpolation interval, but neither the cap nor the rate \
heuristic establishes convergence by itself."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7fcf59b5-a5ca-2155-25f5-50fecc7f73bf"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Assemble one trajectory. Build the piecewise-smooth forcing, form the \
random ODE ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   OverscriptBox[
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["v", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], "."], "=", 
   SubscriptBox[
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], 
    StyleBox["Strat",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["v", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "+", 
   SubscriptBox[
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["b", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], 
    StyleBox["Strat",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["v", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["W", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["h", "TI"], "\[Prime]"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "023f49e2-a747-9723-33c5-60cfd2f3fa09"],
 " for the full four-vector, and hand it to ",
 Cell[BoxData["NDSolve"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "21aa1c49-e16c-f406-57a9-9612901edf6c"],
 ". If no cap is supplied, use one quarter of the realized noise-grid spacing:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"289b85cd-827f-9a9c-58b8-1c97370be8e6"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "oneTraj", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"oneTraj", "[", 
    RowBox[{
    "r_", ",", " ", "init_", ",", " ", "tf_", ",", " ", "dtGen_", ",", " ", 
     "seed_", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"maxstep_", " ", ":", " ", "Automatic"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"goal_", " ", ":", " ", "Automatic"}]}], "]"}], " ", ":=", "\n", 
   "  ", 
   RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
      "Wf", ",", " ", "xx", ",", " ", "yy", ",", " ", "zz", ",", " ", "QQ", ",",
        " ", "t", ",", " ", "rhs", ",", " ", "eqs", ",", " ", "stepCap"}], 
      "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Wf", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"wienerFun", "[", 
        RowBox[{"tf", ",", " ", "dtGen", ",", " ", "seed"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
      "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"stepCap", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Replace", "[", 
        RowBox[{"maxstep", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Automatic", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"noiseStep", "[", 
            RowBox[{"tf", ",", " ", "dtGen"}], "]"}], "/", "4"}]}]}], "]"}]}],
       ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"rhs", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"driftStrat", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"xx", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"yy", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"zz", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"QQ", "[", "t", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", "r"}], "]"}], 
        " ", "+", "\n", "     ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"diffStrat", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"xx", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"yy", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"zz", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"QQ", "[", "t", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", "r"}], "]"}], " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Wf", "'"}], "[", "t", "]"}]}]}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"eqs", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"MapThread", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"#1", "'"}], "[", "t", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", "#2"}], 
            " ", "&"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"xx", ",", " ", "yy", ",", " ", "zz", ",", " ", "QQ"}], 
              "}"}], ",", " ", "rhs"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", "\n", "     ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"xx", "[", "0", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", 
            RowBox[{"init", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"yy", "[", "0", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", 
            RowBox[{"init", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"zz", "[", "0", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", 
            RowBox[{"init", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"QQ", "[", "0", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", 
            RowBox[{"init", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", "4", "]"}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", 
      "   ", 
      RowBox[{"NDSolveValue", "[", 
       RowBox[{"eqs", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"xx", ",", " ", "yy", ",", " ", "zz", ",", " ", "QQ"}], 
         "}"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"t", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "tf"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"MaxStepSize", " ", "->", " ", "stepCap"}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
        RowBox[{"AccuracyGoal", " ", "->", " ", "goal"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"PrecisionGoal", " ", "->", " ", "goal"}]}], "]"}]}]}], 
    "]"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[19]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"12f3dbee-abc4-6375-4280-d2cbce714e5f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Show one trajectory two ways: the monitored component ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["z", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7ed5da6f-a344-b859-26ea-dc48d6f60aa3"],
 " against the exact Lindblad mean, and the readout ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["Q", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2cfa2c34-ef50-7d46-5499-c6718ae547ac"],
 " it accumulates, both built from the single four-vector solution:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"362a4e41-4988-041f-5e2a-602b683d6f65"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"With", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"traj", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"oneTraj", "[", 
       RowBox[{"ratesB", ",", " ", "initB", ",", " ", "tfB", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"dtGenOf", "[", "ratesB", "]"}], ",", " ", "7", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"dtGenOf", "[", "ratesB", "]"}], "/", "4"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", 
     "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"lb", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"lindbladBloch", "[", 
       RowBox[{"ratesB", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"initB", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", 
          RowBox[{"1", " ", ";;", " ", "3"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}], 
    "}"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Row", "[", 
    RowBox[{"{", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Plot", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"traj", "[", 
            RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}], "[", "t", "]"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"lb", "[", "t", "]"}], "[", 
           RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"t", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "tfB"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", 
        "    ", 
        RowBox[{"PlotLegends", " ", "->", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Placed", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"{", 
            
            RowBox[{"\"\<one trajectory z(t)\>\"", ",", 
             " ", "\"\<Lindblad \[LeftAngleBracket]z\[RightAngleBracket](t)\>\
\""}], "}"}], ",", " ", "Below"}], "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
        RowBox[{"Frame", " ", "->", " ", "True"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"GridLines", " ", "->", " ", "Automatic"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"FrameLabel", " ", "->", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<t\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<z\>\""}], "}"}]}], ",", "\n", 
        "    ", 
        RowBox[{
        "PlotLabel", " ", "->", 
         " ", "\"\<state: the monitored component\>\""}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"ImageSize", " ", "->", " ", "Medium"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
      " ", "\"\<   \>\"", ",", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"Plot", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"traj", "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", "4", "]"}], "]"}], "[", "t", "]"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"t", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "tfB"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", 
        "    ", 
        RowBox[{"Frame", " ", "->", " ", "True"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"GridLines", " ", "->", " ", "Automatic"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"FrameLabel", " ", "->", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<t\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<Q\>\""}], "}"}]}], ",", "\n", 
        "    ", 
        RowBox[{
        "PlotLabel", " ", "->", 
         " ", "\"\<readout: the accumulated record Q(t)\>\""}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"ImageSize", " ", "->", " ", "Medium"}]}], "]"}]}], "}"}], 
    "]"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[20]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"01ed6b92-5a5f-fa78-3792-82dc5febc942"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "As one can see, the state path fluctuates around the Lindblad mean, as a \
single record must, while the readout ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["Q", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "107fa29c-d013-1000-4004-3bd9e1a6636a"],
 " climbs steeply where ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["z", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6798df62-4cc7-e4e1-0da7-d74c6573cecb"],
 " is near one and bends as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["z", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "49f5450b-e8d1-97dd-7f8b-5d548965fd27"],
 " falls, its ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SqrtBox[
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], " ", 
   StyleBox["z", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2570a8a5-7a6f-59e7-530f-410f7f1a2bcd"],
 " signal buried under noise. The two panels share one ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox[
   RowBox[{"d", "W"}], "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0b990c23-b656-01a6-39a6-a58cc3e3538c"],
 ", and that is the physical content of a measurement record: the noise \
written into ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["Q", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "52243646-2fbd-210e-03db-a8204a487054"],
 " is the same noise that kicked ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["z", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1acd7f4d-3da3-7753-4af3-7717b4565db9"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"062d91f0-6326-41c0-2fd2-08ba16d3132a"],

Cell["The ensemble: matching the mean and the spread", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"1ac7f74a-ce09-be58-4afc-ef17ebbd04a2"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A single path tells us little about the law. We therefore retain full \
trajectories from two finite-step simulations: the built-in ",
 Cell[BoxData["StratonovichProcess"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6f6ad260-8ee1-565a-1569-d44a2a943ca0"],
 " integrator and the regularized ",
 Cell[BoxData["NDSolve"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "612fd791-c81e-86f2-10d4-cedae9a8ecd8"],
 " route. Their means can be compared with the closed Lindblad solution, \
while their spreads probe information that the mean cannot see. Agreement is \
evidence at the stated time steps and sample size; it is not by itself a \
convergence theorem."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"26dca2d1-2715-746d-4ee3-3b9b52a05eb7"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Before any simulation, let's verify the It\[OHat]-Stratonovich conversion. \
If the explicit Stratonovich drift truly carries the correction, its \
It\[OHat] form must be the affine drift ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  OverscriptBox[
   StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "296a77cd-8fa3-dd44-5f6a-6e972a57a7ae"],
 " we encoded as ",
 Cell[BoxData["driftIto"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6b853673-18d0-d9fa-19ba-a83d996aabc0"],
 " for the Lindblad reference, with the readout row untouched. Convert the \
full four-component field and test it against that target, under the physical \
assumption that the rates are nonnegative (needed only to fold ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SqrtBox[
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], " ", 
   SqrtBox[
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"B", "A"}], "TI"]]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "25b5b884-ef74-61b3-534a-31e18a013399"],
 " into a single root):"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"574a2197-51ef-7938-7d49-b8d1679a4802"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Assuming", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Subscript", "[", 
       RowBox[{"\[CapitalGamma]", ",", " ", "\"\<CI\>\""}], "]"}], " ", ">=", 
      " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Subscript", "[", 
       RowBox[{"\[CapitalGamma]", ",", " ", "\"\<BA\>\""}], "]"}], " ", ">=", 
      " ", "0"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[", "\n", "  ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"ItoProcess", "[", 
         RowBox[{"StratonovichProcess", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"driftStrat", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"{", 
                RowBox[{"x", ",", " ", "y", ",", " ", "z", ",", " ", "q"}], 
                "}"}], ",", " ", "ratesSym"}], "]"}], ",", "\n", "        ", 
             RowBox[{"List", " ", "/@", " ", 
              RowBox[{"diffStrat", "[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"{", 
                 RowBox[{"x", ",", " ", "y", ",", " ", "z", ",", " ", "q"}], 
                 "}"}], ",", " ", "ratesSym"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"x", ",", " ", "y", ",", " ", "z", ",", " ", "q"}], 
              "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "       ", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"x", ",", " ", "y", ",", " ", "z", ",", " ", "q"}], 
              "}"}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"x0", ",", " ", "y0", ",", " ", "z0", ",", " ", "q0"}], 
              "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", "t"}], "]"}], "]"}], 
        "[", "\"\<Drift\>\"", "]"}], " ", "/.", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"x", "[", "t", "]"}], " ", "->", " ", "x"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"y", "[", "t", "]"}], " ", "->", " ", "y"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"z", "[", "t", "]"}], " ", "->", " ", "z"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"q", "[", "t", "]"}], " ", "->", " ", "q"}]}], "}"}]}], 
      ")"}], "\n", "   ", "==", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Append", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"driftIto", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"x", ",", " ", "y", ",", " ", "z"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
         "ratesSym"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
         RowBox[{"Subscript", "[", 
          RowBox[{"\[CapitalGamma]", ",", " ", "\"\<CI\>\""}], "]"}], "]"}], " ",
         "z"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[21]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"6e85e9ed-427b-8528-16ba-00b7770fec72"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The equality holds row by row: the It\[OHat] form of the Stratonovich SDE \
we hand ",
 Cell[BoxData["NDSolve"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "73b76025-96bb-3fff-214d-798f234f85c5"],
 " is exactly the affine drift on all three Bloch rows, with the readout row \
unchanged, so the correction is carried in full and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["Q", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "31f4c073-8ff6-126f-678b-da3d298360b5"],
 " is the same in both calculi."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"72ff7667-e560-b2c0-2285-68408c1a002a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The trajectories are independent integrations, so the regularized generator \
below spreads them across local subkernels with ",
 Cell[BoxData["ParallelTable"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7c9be80e-0554-61c1-24b8-0268ace1332b"],
 ", which launches the configured kernels on its first use and ships the ",
 Cell[BoxData["Global"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "106b7ad8-6378-599b-4069-7382160d2be1"],
 " context definitions to them automatically. The wall-clock gain is set by \
the machine's core mix and scheduling, typically a factor of a few rather \
than the kernel count; with no subkernels available the same cells simply \
evaluate sequentially."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7e6f7c7a-fa8f-2da1-2615-7627ff3a778b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Generate ",
 Cell[BoxData["ntraj"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "304452a4-201b-d64c-607c-4b0e51afbc96"],
 " full trajectories from the built-in ",
 Cell[BoxData["StratonovichProcess"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6beff1f8-c64a-83a6-1994-e8a5f3fcd18c"],
 " integrator. Feed it the same four-row Stratonovich field and request the \
",
 ButtonBox["documented order-$3/2$ scalar-noise method",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->{
    URL["https://reference.wolfram.com/language/ref/StratonovichProcess.html"]\
, None}],
 " rather than the default order-",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"1", "/", "2"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4b5b9263-9199-4e16-7978-144d202c157c"],
 " Euler-Maruyama method. The method order describes asymptotic \
discretization behavior; it does not remove finite-step bias:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"475d7054-346c-a3cc-6d63-6a1ebd1ef116"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "stratRun", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"stratRun", "[", 
    RowBox[{
    "r_", ",", " ", "init_", ",", " ", "tf_", ",", " ", "dt_", ",", " ", 
     "ntraj_", ",", " ", "seed_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", "\n", "  ", 
   RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"t", ",", " ", "v", ",", " ", "proc", ",", " ", "td"}], "}"}], ",",
      "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"v", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"\[FormalX]", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\[FormalY]", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\[FormalZ]", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\[FormalQ]", "[", "t", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"proc", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"StratonovichProcess", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"driftStrat", "[", 
            RowBox[{"v", ",", " ", "r"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"List", " ", "/@", " ", 
            RowBox[{"diffStrat", "[", 
             RowBox[{"v", ",", " ", "r"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", "v"}], "}"}], ",",
          "\n", "     ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
            "\[FormalX]", ",", " ", "\[FormalY]", ",", " ", "\[FormalZ]", ",",
              " ", "\[FormalQ]"}], "}"}], ",", " ", "init"}], "}"}], ",", " ",
          "t"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"td", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"BlockRandom", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"SeedRandom", "[", "seed", "]"}], ";", "\n", "     ", 
         RowBox[{"RandomFunction", "[", 
          RowBox[{"proc", ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"0.", ",", " ", "tf", ",", " ", "dt"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
           "ntraj", ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{
           "Method", " ", "->", 
            " ", "\"\<StochasticRungeKuttaScalarNoise\>\""}]}], "]"}]}], 
        "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"td", "[", "\"\<ValueList\>\"", "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[22]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"2ef71510-aa09-eca9-568c-8d5dcfbdb6f3"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Generate the same count of regularized trajectories, each ",
 Cell[BoxData["NDSolve"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3343f580-98d5-e31c-6170-ecea1961ce66"],
 " solution read off on a shared time grid, keeping all four components so \
the record stays beside the state that produced it. Three arguments carry \
defaults: the integration-step cap is one quarter of the realized noise \
spacing, the read-off grid is the noise grid itself, and the solver goals \
pass to ",
 Cell[BoxData["NDSolve"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "20a7420b-376a-b23f-505d-6455421c0105"],
 " unchanged:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6af863a9-1098-c609-1a98-7af3a112ad53"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "regRun", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"regRun", "[", 
    RowBox[{
    "r_", ",", " ", "init_", ",", " ", "tf_", ",", " ", "dtGen_", ",", " ", 
     "ntraj_", ",", " ", "baseSeed_", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"maxstep_", " ", ":", " ", "Automatic"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"grid_", " ", ":", " ", "Automatic"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"goal_", " ", ":", " ", "Automatic"}]}], "]"}], " ", ":=", "\n", 
   "  ", 
   RowBox[{"With", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"ms", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"maxstep", " ", "/.", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Automatic", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"noiseStep", "[", 
            RowBox[{"tf", ",", " ", "dtGen"}], "]"}], "/", "4"}]}]}]}], ",", 
       "\n", "    ", 
       RowBox[{"g", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"grid", " ", "/.", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Automatic", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"noiseGrid", "[", 
           RowBox[{"tf", ",", " ", "dtGen"}], "]"}]}]}]}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n",
      "   ", 
     RowBox[{"ParallelTable", "[", "\n", "    ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"With", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"tr", " ", "=", " ", 
           RowBox[{"oneTraj", "[", 
            RowBox[{
            "r", ",", " ", "init", ",", " ", "tf", ",", " ", "dtGen", ",", 
             " ", 
             RowBox[{"baseSeed", " ", "+", " ", "i"}], ",", " ", "ms", ",", 
             " ", "goal"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "     ", 
         RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"#", "[", "g", "]"}], " ", "&"}], " ", "/@", " ", "tr"}], 
          "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"i", ",", " ", "ntraj"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[23]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"055bc2ad-6b92-a3be-3378-dbf70e24f184"],

Cell["\<\
For the harder regimes and the step-size study below we will want only the \
final values, so reduce each generator to them. The native final Bloch \
vectors:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2b0fb60e-2211-365f-5934-286857a59ca5"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "stratRef", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"stratRef", "[", 
    RowBox[{
    "r_", ",", " ", "init_", ",", " ", "tf_", ",", " ", "dt_", ",", " ", 
     "ntraj_", ",", " ", "seed_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"stratRun", "[", 
     RowBox[{
     "r", ",", " ", "init", ",", " ", "tf", ",", " ", "dt", ",", " ", "ntraj",
       ",", " ", "seed"}], "]"}], "[", 
    RowBox[{"[", 
     RowBox[{"All", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"1", " ", ";;", " ", "3"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[24]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"201a2509-bdd9-2fa1-5039-bd53346c758b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "And the regularized final Bloch vectors, read off at ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox[
   StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["f", "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7085d256-6adc-aa08-20ba-d4100f6ef952"],
 " alone, the cap and the goals defaulting the same way:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5f932952-49a5-d34f-05a0-c11c6851a195"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "ensemble", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"ensemble", "[", 
    RowBox[{
    "r_", ",", " ", "init_", ",", " ", "tf_", ",", " ", "dtGen_", ",", " ", 
     "ntraj_", ",", " ", "baseSeed_", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"maxstep_", " ", ":", " ", "Automatic"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"goal_", " ", ":", " ", "Automatic"}]}], "]"}], " ", ":=", "\n", 
   "  ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"regRun", "[", 
     RowBox[{
     "r", ",", " ", "init", ",", " ", "tf", ",", " ", "dtGen", ",", " ", 
      "ntraj", ",", " ", "baseSeed", ",", " ", "maxstep", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", "tf", "}"}], ",", " ", "goal"}], "]"}], "[", 
    RowBox[{"[", 
     RowBox[{"All", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"1", " ", ";;", " ", "3"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[25]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"160f17c4-d31a-fe19-3e34-8ea1e6acc563"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Run both on the representative case, on the shared grid set by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"dtGenOf", "[", "ratesB", "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "10beb8bd-bdb6-ee93-4045-31e73440b4f9"],
 ". First the native ensemble:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3fdc991b-fead-14b0-65e3-1144fb587e9a"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"stratRunB", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"stratRun", "[", 
    RowBox[{"ratesB", ",", " ", "initB", ",", " ", "tfB", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"dtGenOf", "[", "ratesB", "]"}], ",", " ", "nB", ",", " ", 
     "2024"}], "]"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[26]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"3657d2c5-05c0-ac85-5e6c-cbafac7af6ef"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Then the regularized ensemble on the same grid. Its displayed statistics \
resolve differences only at Monte-Carlo scale, so the production ensembles \
pass ",
 Cell[BoxData["AccuracyGoal"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0642d375-09f3-9942-2e71-cb3faf87eba8"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData["PrecisionGoal"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0651775d-2bad-791b-2e6f-6f074e584861"],
 " of five to ",
 Cell[BoxData["NDSolve"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "63b9e3d6-2298-231e-1146-fa9057128e64"],
 "; the pathwise identity checks below, where solver error itself is on \
display, keep the defaults:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"67c13665-f813-2f11-0dfe-a84ef9a6727b"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"regRunB", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"regRun", "[", 
    RowBox[{"ratesB", ",", " ", "initB", ",", " ", "tfB", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"dtGenOf", "[", "ratesB", "]"}], ",", " ", "nB", ",", " ", 
     "9100", ",", " ", "Automatic", ",", " ", "Automatic", ",", " ", "5"}], 
    "]"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[27]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"4c440104-ea8a-4285-747b-99618f3f10ef"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Average each ensemble over its trajectories and compare the two mean paths \
of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["z", "TI"], "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
   StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "66c9a615-af45-c085-0ef6-385ecaf192ef"],
 " against the single exact Lindblad trajectory:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0513e607-0f4c-1e20-3320-f861aaf9650a"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"With", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"g", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"noiseGrid", "[", 
       RowBox[{"tfB", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"dtGenOf", "[", "ratesB", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"lb", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"lindbladBloch", "[", 
       RowBox[{"ratesB", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"initB", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", 
          RowBox[{"1", " ", ";;", " ", "3"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}], 
    "}"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{"ListLinePlot", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", "\n", "    ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"g", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Mean", "[", "stratRunB", "]"}], "[", 
           RowBox[{"[", 
            RowBox[{"All", ",", " ", "3"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], "]"}], ",",
        "\n", "    ", 
       RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"g", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Mean", "[", "regRunB", "]"}], "[", 
           RowBox[{"[", 
            RowBox[{"All", ",", " ", "3"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], "]"}], ",",
        "\n", "    ", 
       RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"g", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"lb", "[", "#", "]"}], "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "&"}], " ", "/@", " ", 
           "g"}]}], "}"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"PlotStyle", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"Automatic", ",", " ", "Dashed", ",", " ", "Thick"}], "}"}]}], 
     ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"PlotLegends", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<StratonovichProcess mean\>\"", ",", 
        " ", "\"\<regularized mean\>\"", ",", 
        " ", "\"\<Lindblad \[LeftAngleBracket]z\[RightAngleBracket](t)\>\""}],
        "}"}]}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"Frame", " ", "->", " ", "True"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"GridLines", " ", "->", " ", "Automatic"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"FrameLabel", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<t\>\"", ",", 
        " ", "\"\<\[LeftAngleBracket]z\[RightAngleBracket]\>\""}], "}"}]}], ",",
      "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{
     "PlotLabel", " ", "->", 
      " ", "\"\<averaging the trajectories rebuilds the master \
equation\>\""}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[28]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"0371ff35-cd30-cda2-310e-f77ee4ca9788"],

Cell["\<\
The plot compares both sampled ensemble means with the exact Lindblad curve \
over the whole stored grid. In the white-noise theory the ensemble average \
obeys the master equation exactly; finite ensembles fluctuate around it.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6833ae6a-6ac5-a2c8-19c0-40340f71f012"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Quantify the largest gap between the regularized mean of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["z", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5f7f2999-1aee-25a5-0504-c0c39e988f8f"],
 " and the Lindblad value anywhere on the grid, in Monte-Carlo standard \
errors, skipping ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["t", "TI"], "=", "0"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "128c7526-c883-085d-42b4-6c83e9365aa7"],
 " (where all paths coincide and the standard error vanishes):"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3279c00f-c9e2-8758-6206-da68ef94eda2"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"With", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"g", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Rest", "[", 
       RowBox[{"noiseGrid", "[", 
        RowBox[{"tfB", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"dtGenOf", "[", "ratesB", "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
     
     RowBox[{"lb", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"lindbladBloch", "[", 
       RowBox[{"ratesB", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"initB", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", 
          RowBox[{"1", " ", ";;", " ", "3"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", 
     "\n", "  ", 
     RowBox[{"zc", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"regRunB", "[", 
       RowBox[{"[", 
        RowBox[{"All", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"2", " ", ";;"}], ",", " ", "3"}], "]"}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}], ",",
    "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Mean", "[", "zc", "]"}], " ", "-", " ", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"lb", "[", "#", "]"}], "[", 
           RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "&"}], " ", "/@", " ", "g"}], 
        ")"}]}], "]"}], "/", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"StandardDeviation", "[", "zc", "]"}], "/", 
       RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "nB", "]"}]}], ")"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[29]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"50b12ff8-e606-85f7-004e-c6a593b0efdd"],

Cell["\<\
This is the largest pointwise standardized gap on the stored grid. Because it \
is a maximum over many correlated times, ordinary one-, two-, or \
three-standard-error thresholds do not calibrate it as a simultaneous test. \
Use it as a scale diagnostic; a formal whole-curve test would require the \
sampling distribution of the maximum, for example from an independent \
bootstrap.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"640f47a5-4648-c62d-0c35-5e0f73e2ad77"],

Cell["\<\
The mean sees only the drift, so it is a weak test. The measurement \
backaction lives in the standard deviation of the final Bloch vector, its \
spread across the ensemble, compared across the two routes:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"63a48922-0fac-666c-115b-208caa594cb6"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"TableForm", "[", "\n", " ", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"StandardDeviation", "[", 
       RowBox[{"stratRunB", "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", 
         RowBox[{"All", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"1", " ", ";;", " ", "3"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
      "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"StandardDeviation", "[", 
       RowBox[{"regRunB", "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", 
         RowBox[{"All", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"1", " ", ";;", " ", "3"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], 
    "]"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{"TableHeadings", " ", "->", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<Spread in x\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<Spread in y\>\"", ",", 
        " ", "\"\<Spread in z\>\""}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<Stratonovich\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<Regularized\>\""}], 
       "}"}]}], "}"}]}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[30]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"387a9e0d-0234-0e73-6819-1057b7c15559"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The displayed spreads provide a diffusion-sensitive comparison between the \
two finite-step routes. All three components fluctuate: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["x", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3f64ca0d-9927-5f44-651b-ec5718d225ae"],
 " starts at zero and its mean stays there, yet the backaction quadrature \
feeds its fluctuations from ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["y", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "399d1ff3-4632-be92-6fa2-96bd73c404f8"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1170384d-2f38-2c50-470f-b2174acd76ba"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The sample spread is itself uncertain. A large-sample delta-method estimate \
is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["SE",
    FontSlant->"Plain"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["s", "TI"], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "\[TildeTilde]", 
   SqrtBox[
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["(",
      SpanMaxSize->1], 
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["m", "TI"], "4"], "-", 
      SuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["s", "TI"], "4"]}], 
     StyleBox[")",
      SpanMaxSize->1], "/", 
     StyleBox["(",
      SpanMaxSize->1], 
     RowBox[{"4", 
      SuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["s", "TI"], "2"], 
      StyleBox["n", "TI"]}], 
     StyleBox[")",
      SpanMaxSize->1]}]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6ce33075-6d34-44a7-1490-aa3f04c12e8d"],
 ", where ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox[
   StyleBox["m", "TI"], "4"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "54e2b6d5-0ba4-5b19-7c91-2f9fae512663"],
 " is the fourth central moment. The plug-in code below estimates the moments \
from the same sample. It is an asymptotic scale estimate, not an exact \
finite-sample error bar."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6334ac9c-43f1-85c0-12cb-45c67585ef2a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Encode ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["SE",
   FontSlant->"Plain"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "74397683-04f4-1d4d-1dc7-6fedac816797"],
 ", the error bar of one spread, both moments read off the sample:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"735e49d5-32a1-4a48-2166-609f47541892"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "sdErr", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"sdErr", "[", "x_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"With", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"v", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"CentralMoment", "[", 
        RowBox[{"x", ",", " ", "2"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"CentralMoment", "[", 
          RowBox[{"x", ",", " ", "4"}], "]"}], " ", "-", " ", 
         RowBox[{"v", "^", "2"}]}], ")"}], "/", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"4", " ", "v", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Length", "[", "x", "]"}]}], ")"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[31]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"335d55a2-cf9b-493d-6163-4c0fea2e1807"],

Cell["\<\
Compare the Stratonovich and regularized spreads by dividing their absolute \
difference by their combined standard error,\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3bfbbd45-edb8-1b0b-6998-352e844d6651"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["G", "TI"], "=", 
    FractionBox[GridBox[{
       {
        RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["s", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["Strat",
           FontSlant->"Plain"]], "-", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["s", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["reg",
           FontSlant->"Plain"]]}]}
      },
      GridBoxDividers->{"Columns" -> {True, True}, "Rows" -> {}},
      GridBoxSpacings->{"Columns" -> {{0.15}}}], 
     SqrtBox[
      RowBox[{
       StyleBox["SE",
        FontSlant->"Plain"], 
       SuperscriptBox[
        RowBox[{
         StyleBox["(",
          SpanMaxSize->1], 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["s", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["Strat",
           FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
         StyleBox[")",
          SpanMaxSize->1]}], "2"], "+", 
       StyleBox["SE",
        FontSlant->"Plain"], 
       SuperscriptBox[
        RowBox[{
         StyleBox["(",
          SpanMaxSize->1], 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["s", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["reg",
           FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
         StyleBox[")",
          SpanMaxSize->1]}], "2"]}]]]}], ","}],
  Alignment->Center,
  ImageSize->Full]], "DisplayFormula",ExpressionUUID->"045023ab-c37d-b770-2c6f-baf4f6091a5a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "so ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["G", "TI"], "=", "1"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "73e8aeff-5b91-f8f4-2197-47b95e25cade"],
 " means that the two spreads differ by one combined standard error. Encode \
this statistic:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"33e490f1-5bc8-e939-619b-09bb5e62b803"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "spreadGap", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"spreadGap", "[", 
    RowBox[{"x1_", ",", " ", "x2_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"StandardDeviation", "[", "x1", "]"}], " ", "-", " ", 
      RowBox[{"StandardDeviation", "[", "x2", "]"}]}], "]"}], "/", "\n", 
    "   ", 
    RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"sdErr", "[", "x1", "]"}], "^", "2"}], " ", "+", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"sdErr", "[", "x2", "]"}], "^", "2"}]}], "]"}]}]}], 
  ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[32]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"794a4309-908b-2549-2f4a-5b53213f8f93"],

Cell["Read each component's gap in those units:", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"167ebcf0-2b32-2a61-3e05-35ba4ec7794b"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"AssociationThread", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"\"\<Spread gap in x\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<Spread gap in y\>\"", ",",
      "\n", "  ", "\"\<Spread gap in z\>\""}], "}"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{"spreadGap", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"stratRunB", "[", 
      RowBox[{"[", 
       RowBox[{"All", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"1", " ", ";;", " ", "3"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"regRunB", "[", 
      RowBox[{"[", 
       RowBox[{"All", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"1", " ", ";;", " ", "3"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], 
  "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[33]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"15eb24b6-b946-3a65-43e8-bdf038f0894f"],

Cell["\<\
The returned numbers express each spread difference in approximate \
combined-standard-error units. They are useful diagnostics, but they are not \
a distribution-free hypothesis test and do not justify the phrase \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]statistically \
indistinguishable\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] without a calibrated sampling \
analysis.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"27d2a24c-1e84-19ee-4de1-44169b316b34"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The conditional state must stay in the unit Bloch ball. On its boundary the \
radial diffusion vanishes, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["x", "TI"], ",", 
    StyleBox["y", "TI"], ",", 
    StyleBox["z", "TI"]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "\[CenterDot]", 
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["b", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], "=", 
   SqrtBox[
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], 
   StyleBox["z", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{"1", "-", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["x", "TI"], "2"], "-", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["y", "TI"], "2"], "-", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["z", "TI"], "2"]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "=", "0"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "285985c7-a1c8-13eb-5866-1ca0d07d6131"],
 ". The remaining stochastic-invariance condition is that the It\[OHat] \
generator applied to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["r", "TI"], "2"], "=", 
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["x", "TI"], "2"], "+", 
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["y", "TI"], "2"], "+", 
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["z", "TI"], "2"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "57868ed1-450c-c474-7dbd-279b6cbeaf5e"],
 " point inward or tangent there. Its boundary value is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"2", 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["x", "TI"], ",", 
    StyleBox["y", "TI"], ",", 
    StyleBox["z", "TI"]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "\[CenterDot]", 
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], "+", 
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["b", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], "\[CenterDot]", 
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["b", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0c5e608e-35dc-f74f-3466-79e8bc6edd95"],
 ":"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1a1e4090-3303-05ed-4a26-59da46b66f37"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"\[ScriptCapitalL]", 
       StyleBox["(",
        SpanMaxSize->1], 
       SuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["r", "TI"], "2"], 
       StyleBox[")",
        SpanMaxSize->1]}], "\[RightBracketingBar]"}], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["r", "TI"], "=", "1"}]], "=", 
    StyleBox["(",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    RowBox[{"1", "-", 
     SuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["z", "TI"], "2"]}], 
    StyleBox[")",
     SpanMaxSize->1], " ", 
    StyleBox["(",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
      StyleBox[
       RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]], "+", 
     SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
      StyleBox[
       RowBox[{"B", "A"}], "TI"]], "-", "2", 
     StyleBox["(",
      SpanMaxSize->1], 
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
       StyleBox["d", "TI"]], "+", 
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]]}], 
     StyleBox[")",
      SpanMaxSize->1]}], 
    StyleBox[")",
     SpanMaxSize->1], "-", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], "1"], 
    SuperscriptBox[
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["(",
       SpanMaxSize->1], 
      RowBox[{"1", "-", 
       StyleBox["z", "TI"]}], 
      StyleBox[")",
       SpanMaxSize->1]}], "2"]}], ","}],
  Alignment->Center,
  ImageSize->Full]], "DisplayFormula",ExpressionUUID->"10256af3-3972-af7a-41da-83bdb804f240"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "where ",
 Cell[BoxData["\[ScriptCapitalL]"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "457602f1-d86e-ac86-730d-9bbad918f6ec"],
 " is the It\[OHat] generator."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"499f95c1-a958-6c18-7fa4-0caac8ed3762"],

Cell["\<\
Verify that closed form, substituting a point on the sphere and subtracting \
the claim:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0f1e874b-6d22-b8ab-3525-1f1504d40af1"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"With", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"b3", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"diffStrat", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"x", ",", " ", "y", ",", " ", "z", ",", " ", "q"}], "}"}], ",",
         " ", "ratesSym"}], "]"}], "[", 
      RowBox[{"[", 
       RowBox[{"1", " ", ";;", " ", "3"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", 
   " ", 
   RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"2", " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"x", ",", " ", "y", ",", " ", "z"}], "}"}], " ", ".", " ", 
           RowBox[{"driftIto", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"x", ",", " ", "y", ",", " ", "z"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
             "ratesSym"}], "]"}]}]}], " ", "+", " ", 
         RowBox[{"b3", " ", ".", " ", "b3"}]}], ")"}], " ", "/.", "\n", 
       "     ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"x", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
            RowBox[{"1", " ", "-", " ", 
             RowBox[{"z", "^", "2"}]}], "]"}], " ", 
           RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "\[Phi]", "]"}]}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"y", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
            RowBox[{"1", " ", "-", " ", 
             RowBox[{"z", "^", "2"}]}], "]"}], " ", 
           RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "\[Phi]", "]"}]}]}]}], "}"}]}], ")"}], " ", "-",
      "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"1", " ", "-", " ", 
          RowBox[{"z", "^", "2"}]}], ")"}], " ", 
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"ratesSym", "[", 
           RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "+", " ", 
          RowBox[{"ratesSym", "[", 
           RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "-", " ", 
          RowBox[{"2", " ", 
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"ratesSym", "[", 
              RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "+", " ", 
             RowBox[{"ratesSym", "[", 
              RowBox[{"[", "4", "]"}], "]"}]}], ")"}]}]}], ")"}]}], " ", "-", 
       "\n", "     ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"ratesSym", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "5", "]"}], "]"}], " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{"1", " ", "-", " ", "z"}], ")"}], "^", "2"}]}]}], ")"}]}], 
    "]"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[34]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"0c02104f-9807-e6c4-3431-8a2919b3cc2e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The subtraction cancels identically. The relaxation term is nonpositive and \
vanishes quadratically at the ground pole, whereas the measurement term is \
linear in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"1", "-", 
   StyleBox["z", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6f909018-5ea1-6a32-15af-0a425b543918"],
 " near that pole. Consequently the generator is inward or tangent at every \
boundary point if and only if ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
    StyleBox[
     RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]], "+", 
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
    StyleBox[
     RowBox[{"B", "A"}], "TI"]], "\[LessEqual]", "2", 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox["d", "TI"]], "+", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2f4595f3-090a-1216-557a-0cbda8bf617c"],
 ". Under nonnegative rates and the usual existence assumptions, this is the \
Bloch-ball invariance condition for this SDE. Every ensemble rate set below \
satisfies it; one single-path example deliberately violates it. The following \
maximum is only a numerical spot-check of the regularized solver:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"06385f5e-e9d4-4e6c-2fd8-571b886114b6"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
  RowBox[{"Map", "[", 
   RowBox[{"Norm", ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"regRunB", "[", 
     RowBox[{"[", 
      RowBox[{"All", ",", " ", "All", ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"1", " ", ";;", " ", "3"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", "2", "}"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[35]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"25d2fb85-296f-82e5-53e1-f2ef481bd0cf"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The radius sits at one to within a hair, with no projection step. Read this \
as a spot-check of positivity, not a proof of it: it samples one ensemble on \
a fixed grid from a state that began on the surface. Violate the \
admissibility condition, which for a detector means ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"], ">", "1", "+", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]], "/", 
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3b9a140e-d97a-4136-69b9-8e6bd80f101c"],
 ", more information extracted than the dephasing paid for, and the equation \
stops being a valid unraveling: the trajectory can leave the ball, and its \
coordinates no longer describe a density matrix. That failure is one cell \
away. Fix rates that fail the check, twice the information the dephasing \
supplies, start on the sphere away from the pole where the closed form above \
makes the flux point outward, and read the largest radius one path reaches:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4f9438da-b80f-a114-75ab-b18439bbf07e"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"With", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"ratesBad", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
      "2.", ",", " ", "0.", ",", " ", "0.5", ",", " ", "0.", ",", " ", "1.", ",",
        " ", "0."}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{"With", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"tr", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"oneTraj", "[", 
        RowBox[{"ratesBad", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"0.8", ",", " ", "0.", ",", " ", "0.6", ",", " ", "0."}], 
          "}"}], ",", " ", "1.", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"dtGenOf", "[", "ratesBad", "]"}], ",", " ", "5", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"dtGenOf", "[", "ratesBad", "]"}], "/", "4"}]}], "]"}]}], 
      "}"}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
     RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
      RowBox[{"Norm", " ", "/@", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"#", "[", 
           RowBox[{"Subdivide", "[", 
            RowBox[{"0.", ",", " ", "1.", ",", " ", "200"}], "]"}], "]"}], 
          " ", "&"}], " ", "/@", " ", 
         RowBox[{"tr", "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", 
           RowBox[{"1", " ", ";;", " ", "3"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], 
      "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[36]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"7281c19b-2602-dcd4-22be-d8c553b4a63e"],

Cell["\<\
The radius runs past one. At the chosen initial boundary point the radial \
diffusion is zero while the radial generator points outward, so the model \
immediately violates the invariance condition. The equation still integrates; \
what fails is its interpretation as a density-matrix trajectory.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3c8746fc-db76-c487-64bd-5fb9de00aeed"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The boundary is just as sharp from the inside. Saturate the condition with \
no relaxation and no intrinsic dephasing, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], "1"], "=", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]], "=", "0"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "11f0f87a-e6f0-91cd-478f-f227928ae317"],
 " with both quadratures on and the drive on too, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
    StyleBox[
     RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]], "+", 
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
    StyleBox[
     RowBox[{"B", "A"}], "TI"]], "=", "2", 
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "473164ce-b547-c1f4-6ecf-7da83cf393de"],
 " exactly, and the closed form above vanishes identically: the sphere itself \
is invariant, so a pure state stays pure along every single trajectory, not \
merely on average. Start a path on the sphere and read how far it ever leaves:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"12c4fc3b-e00c-2bba-42fb-f66491b97980"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"With", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"rPure", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
      "0.352", ",", " ", "0.4", ",", " ", "0.376", ",", " ", "0.", ",", " ", 
       "0.", ",", " ", "3."}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{"With", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"tr", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"oneTraj", "[", 
         RowBox[{"rPure", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"0.6", ",", " ", "0.", ",", " ", "0.8", ",", " ", "0."}], 
           "}"}], ",", " ", "3.", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"dtGenOf", "[", "rPure", "]"}], ",", " ", "5", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"dtGenOf", "[", "rPure", "]"}], "/", "4"}]}], "]"}]}], ",",
        "\n", "   ", 
       RowBox[{"s", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Subdivide", "[", 
         RowBox[{"0.", ",", " ", "3.", ",", " ", "400"}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}], ",",
      "\n", "  ", 
     RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
      RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Norm", " ", "/@", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"#", "[", "s", "]"}], " ", "&"}], " ", "/@", " ", 
           RowBox[{"tr", "[", 
            RowBox[{"[", 
             RowBox[{"1", " ", ";;", " ", "3"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], " ",
         "-", " ", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[37]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"1d7e6892-18cd-6f45-4b05-81dc997835af"],

Cell["\<\
The radius sticks to the sphere at solver error, the sharpest test of the \
diffusion's scale in the document: a noise term wrong by any factor would \
walk the path off the sphere at once. On the boundary, positivity is not an \
inequality respected but an equality enforced.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"325c8f47-cd85-89da-6263-2720e431db20"],

Cell["The readout: the average signal and the shared noise", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"43fcea2e-12ab-c026-7183-0388a75f930c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "We carried the readout ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["Q", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5b416c07-c3d3-bf4f-097e-8660f6670595"],
 " beside the state through every run but have only looked at the state. Turn \
to the record itself. Taking the mean of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["Q", "TI"], "=", 
   SqrtBox[
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], " ", 
   StyleBox["z", "TI"], " ", 
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["t", "TI"], "+", 
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["W", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5add4728-e92e-eff1-0ae3-5f7588d8b5db"],
 " and using ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{"d", "W"}], "TI"], "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
   StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "=", "0"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "621761a3-d300-b412-122d-780ce6ba1f78"],
 ", the average record is the integrated signal,"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5b08d465-1dcc-fb87-0937-ce4f947ec9ed"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["Q", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["(",
      SpanMaxSize->1], 
     StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
     StyleBox[")",
      SpanMaxSize->1]}], 
    StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
     SpanMaxSize->1], "=", 
    SqrtBox[
     SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
      StyleBox[
       RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], 
    UnderoverscriptBox["\[Integral]", "0", 
     StyleBox["t", "TI"],
     LimitsPositioning->False], 
    StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["z", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["(",
      SpanMaxSize->1], 
     StyleBox["s", "TI"], 
     StyleBox[")",
      SpanMaxSize->1]}], 
    StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
     SpanMaxSize->1], " ", 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["s", "TI"]}], ","}],
  Alignment->Center,
  ImageSize->Full]], "DisplayFormula",ExpressionUUID->"7d3ffb2e-09a8-fc78-24c4-f288a842c742"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "a closed prediction we already hold, since ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["z", "TI"], "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
   StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4139b36b-52b1-2977-70c6-2b356744785d"],
 " is the Lindblad mean. And the records are already in hand: every stored \
trajectory carries ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["Q", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "494d6e39-7750-b6eb-7f72-806302ea1c31"],
 " as its fourth component, so slice the record ensemble out of the same run \
whose state we just averaged:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"39b01e29-d171-5c92-6f4f-9072e00426f8"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"recQB", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"regRunB", "[", 
    RowBox[{"[", 
     RowBox[{"All", ",", " ", "All", ",", " ", "4"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[38]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"4f6d713e-2461-11c8-7513-69784d146312"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The prediction is itself a closed form, not a quadrature: append ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["u", "TI"], "\[Prime]"], "=", 
   SqrtBox[
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], " ", 
   StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["z", "TI"], "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
   StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "14ad582f-66ff-93eb-3c53-5189128be131"],
 " to the affine system and let ",
 Cell[BoxData["DSolve"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4f7ea056-2d28-85ec-7505-3a1044c2ef36"],
 " integrate it exactly:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"16b00368-b832-202d-3e4f-9b3239c77377"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "qpredB", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"qpredB", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
      "sol", ",", " ", "xf", ",", " ", "yf", ",", " ", "zf", ",", " ", "uf", ",",
        " ", "t"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"sol", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"DSolve", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"MapThread", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"#1", "'"}], "[", "t", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", "#2"}],
                " ", "&"}], ",", " ", 
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"{", 
                 RowBox[{"xf", ",", " ", "yf", ",", " ", "zf"}], "}"}], ",", 
                " ", 
                RowBox[{"driftIto", "[", 
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"xf", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"yf", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"zf", "[", "t", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
                  "ratesB"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", "\n", "       ", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"uf", "'"}], "[", "t", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
                 RowBox[{"ratesB", "[", 
                  RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", 
                RowBox[{"zf", "[", "t", "]"}]}]}], ",", " ", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"xf", "[", "0", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", 
               RowBox[{"initB", "[", 
                RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"yf", "[", "0", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", 
               RowBox[{"initB", "[", 
                RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "        ", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"zf", "[", "0", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", 
               RowBox[{"initB", "[", 
                RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"uf", "[", "0", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", "0"}]}], 
             "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"xf", ",", " ", "yf", ",", " ", "zf", ",", " ", "uf"}], 
           "}"}], ",", " ", "t"}], "]"}], " ", "//", " ", "First"}]}], ";", 
      "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
       RowBox[{"tt", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Re", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"uf", "[", "tt", "]"}], " ", "/.", " ", "sol"}], "]"}]}], 
       "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[39]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"06d00634-a672-f252-2eef-9871d304c0b8"],

Cell["Overlay the ensemble-averaged record on that prediction:", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"05feeeaf-4f58-f7b7-3385-07096ad2dd9d"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"With", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"g", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"noiseGrid", "[", 
      RowBox[{"tfB", ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"dtGenOf", "[", "ratesB", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", 
   " ", 
   RowBox[{"ListLinePlot", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"g", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"Mean", "[", "recQB", "]"}]}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"g", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"qpredB", " ", "/@", " ", "g"}]}], "}"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",",
      "\n", "  ", 
     RowBox[{"PlotStyle", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"Automatic", ",", " ", "Thick"}], "}"}]}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
     RowBox[{"PlotLegends", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<ensemble mean \[LeftAngleBracket]Q\[RightAngleBracket](t)\
\>\"", ",", 
        " ", "\"\<\!\(\*SqrtBox[\(\[CapitalGamma]CI\)]\) \[Integral]\
\[LeftAngleBracket]z\[RightAngleBracket] dt\>\""}], "}"}]}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
     
     RowBox[{"Frame", " ", "->", " ", "True"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"GridLines", " ", "->", " ", "Automatic"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"FrameLabel", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<t\>\"", ",", 
        " ", "\"\<\[LeftAngleBracket]Q\[RightAngleBracket]\>\""}], "}"}]}], ",",
      "\n", "  ", 
     RowBox[{
     "PlotLabel", " ", "->", 
      " ", "\"\<the average record is the integrated signal\>\""}]}], "]"}]}],
   "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[40]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"583a98af-415b-100e-09d9-110970ee6354"],

Cell["\<\
As expected, the mean record follows the integrated mean signal. Each \
trajectory satisfies\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"07beae85-a317-6bf9-2d45-47eed6a239c3"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["Q", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["i", "TI"]], 
    StyleBox["(",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
    StyleBox[")",
     SpanMaxSize->1], "=", 
    SqrtBox[
     SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
      StyleBox[
       RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], 
    UnderoverscriptBox["\[Integral]", "0", 
     StyleBox["t", "TI"],
     LimitsPositioning->False], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["z", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["i", "TI"]], 
    StyleBox["(",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    StyleBox["s", "TI"], 
    StyleBox[")",
     SpanMaxSize->1], " ", 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["s", "TI"], "+", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["W", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["i", "TI"]], 
    StyleBox["(",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
    StyleBox[")",
     SpanMaxSize->1]}], ","}],
  Alignment->Center,
  ImageSize->Full]], "DisplayFormula",ExpressionUUID->"503c05d1-55e8-8c5e-01c3-9c9b6382d6a4"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "so averaging ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox[
   StyleBox["n", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["traj",
    FontSlant->"Plain"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "60049622-f570-0e0e-103b-0f8ffc055554"],
 " trajectories gives"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"40ea559d-da93-7842-70ea-4cc6df264aa8"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["Q", "TI"], "_"], 
    StyleBox["(",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
    StyleBox[")",
     SpanMaxSize->1], "=", 
    SqrtBox[
     SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
      StyleBox[
       RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], 
    UnderoverscriptBox["\[Integral]", "0", 
     StyleBox["t", "TI"],
     LimitsPositioning->False], 
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["z", "TI"], "_"], 
    StyleBox["(",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    StyleBox["s", "TI"], 
    StyleBox[")",
     SpanMaxSize->1], " ", 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["s", "TI"], "+", 
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["W", "TI"], "_"], 
    StyleBox["(",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
    StyleBox[")",
     SpanMaxSize->1]}], "."}],
  Alignment->Center,
  ImageSize->Full]], "DisplayFormula",ExpressionUUID->"23ccc6ee-92c0-e596-51f3-dfc8277acffc"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "In the infinite-ensemble limit, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["z", "TI"], "_"], "\[Rule]", 
   StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["z", "TI"], "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
   StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "114d8d02-b276-9c05-4772-256fc700e76f"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["W", "TI"], "_"], "\[Rule]", "0"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2dc22b63-32d1-862f-5bf1-c34d4765ed75"],
 ", recovering the exact prediction ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["Q", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["(",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
    StyleBox[")",
     SpanMaxSize->1]}], 
   StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "=", 
   SqrtBox[
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], 
   UnderoverscriptBox["\[Integral]", "0", 
    StyleBox["t", "TI"],
    LimitsPositioning->False], 
   StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["z", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["(",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    StyleBox["s", "TI"], 
    StyleBox[")",
     SpanMaxSize->1]}], 
   StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], " ", 
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["s", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "36ea7e2c-072a-2221-5eea-7076b2df710b"],
 ". At finite ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox[
   StyleBox["n", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["traj",
    FontSlant->"Plain"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5b23761c-2477-64e8-0ad1-68464d024e32"],
 ", the averaged Wiener path has standard deviation ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SqrtBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["t", "TI"], "/", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["n", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["traj",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "73216bcf-7cf1-61ac-22de-82a9748433f6"],
 ", so it leaves a Brownian-like residual wander rather than cancelling \
exactly. For example, at ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["t", "TI"], "=", "3"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "69fa63e8-c0ca-4913-1f9a-7ab5f17f1879"],
 " with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["n", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["traj",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], "=", "600"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "409bca18-cbd6-e54d-70b8-ec45ee60cf97"],
 ", this direct noise contribution has a standard deviation of about ",
 Cell[BoxData["0.071"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "10b62b5f-1d3f-f012-404d-c31994cbc378"],
 ". The complete discrepancy also includes sampling fluctuations in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  OverscriptBox[
   StyleBox["z", "TI"], "_"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "79984792-c453-565a-2fb8-5edfede63ca0"],
 ", so its appropriate error scale is the standard error of the mean record, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["s", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["Q", "TI"]], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "/", 
   SqrtBox[
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["n", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["traj",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1d45428e-8fa1-6801-4b7b-5be82a543b6b"],
 ". The signal survives averaging, while the statistical fluctuations shrink \
as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"1", "/", 
   SqrtBox[
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["n", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["traj",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "604bb87d-3174-a116-1048-32274006f07c"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"763191a2-6f8b-197a-1fce-080c0a3e6840"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Quantify the agreement at each nonzero grid time ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox[
   StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["j", "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "635fdfdb-2856-deda-1164-d68549e0a420"],
 " with the standardized residual"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0f6eb37a-d9e9-6713-3515-2b27df9c4a79"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["Z", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["Q", "TI"]], 
    StyleBox["(",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["j", "TI"]], 
    StyleBox[")",
     SpanMaxSize->1], "=", 
    FractionBox[GridBox[{
       {
        RowBox[{
         OverscriptBox[
          StyleBox["Q", "TI"], "_"], 
         StyleBox["(",
          SpanMaxSize->1], 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["j", "TI"]], 
         StyleBox[")",
          SpanMaxSize->1], "-", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["Q", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["pred",
           FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
         StyleBox["(",
          SpanMaxSize->1], 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["j", "TI"]], 
         StyleBox[")",
          SpanMaxSize->1]}]}
      },
      GridBoxDividers->{"Columns" -> {True, True}, "Rows" -> {}},
      GridBoxSpacings->{"Columns" -> {{0.15}}}], 
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["s", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["Q", "TI"]], 
      StyleBox["(",
       SpanMaxSize->1], 
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["j", "TI"]], 
      StyleBox[")",
       SpanMaxSize->1], "/", 
      SqrtBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["n", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["traj",
         FontSlant->"Plain"]]]}]]}], ","}],
  Alignment->Center,
  ImageSize->Full]], "DisplayFormula",ExpressionUUID->"5c8469dd-bfc7-2a7a-04bb-80873a727940"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "where ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["Q", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["pred",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["j", "TI"]], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "=", 
   SqrtBox[
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], 
   UnderoverscriptBox["\[Integral]", "0", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["j", "TI"]],
    LimitsPositioning->False], 
   StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["z", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["(",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    StyleBox["s", "TI"], 
    StyleBox[")",
     SpanMaxSize->1]}], 
   StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], " ", 
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["s", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "182ee0c1-720e-fc83-49d5-f9ab07b8c6e9"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["s", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["Q", "TI"]], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["j", "TI"]], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3921e4bb-f5e4-3596-68de-fde483969ffc"],
 " is the sample standard deviation of the records at that time. The \
denominator therefore includes both the direct Wiener noise and the \
trajectory-to-trajectory variation of the integrated signal. Omit ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["t", "TI"], "=", "0"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "13db9173-5387-1c16-41f8-093d6632677c"],
 ", where every record is fixed at zero and the standard error vanishes, and \
report the largest standardized residual on the sampled grid:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6804c0ab-fd16-b7db-183b-d9f4f4a01d21"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"With", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"g", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Rest", "[", 
       RowBox[{"noiseGrid", "[", 
        RowBox[{"tfB", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"dtGenOf", "[", "ratesB", "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
     
     RowBox[{"qc", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"recQB", "[", 
       RowBox[{"[", 
        RowBox[{"All", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"2", " ", ";;"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
   
   RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Mean", "[", "qc", "]"}], " ", "-", " ", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"qpredB", " ", "/@", " ", "g"}], ")"}]}], "]"}], "/", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"StandardDeviation", "[", "qc", "]"}], "/", 
       RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "nB", "]"}]}], ")"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[41]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"77076ae4-09e5-8344-1d3c-83ceaf91d1ae"],

Cell["\<\
The result measures the largest pointwise discrepancy in standard-error \
units. Because the maximum is taken over correlated times, pointwise Gaussian \
thresholds do not give its false-alarm probability. It is a diagnostic of \
scale, not a calibrated simultaneous test and not a claim about unsampled \
times.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4289b0c6-8043-1b93-72b6-29a031f669f9"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The record's spread deserves the same two-route treatment as the state's, \
and the native ensemble has been carrying the fourth row all along; read its \
final-",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["Q", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "070f3e08-556d-9d60-2d34-b0525c19e44a"],
 " spread against the regularized ensemble's, in the same units as before:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6d593b15-c37a-9c59-1b66-b35ef60ce6a3"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"spreadGap", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"stratRunB", "[", 
    RowBox[{"[", 
     RowBox[{"All", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", " ", "4"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"recQB", "[", 
    RowBox[{"[", 
     RowBox[{"All", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[42]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"4140e475-1e41-1f16-777f-fe3f9bf4627c"],

Cell["\<\
The final-record spread supplies the corresponding diffusion-sensitive \
comparison for the fourth row. Here the two finite samples differ on the \
scale estimated above.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"67f13035-938c-831a-0d8e-aa7f263eee60"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The average removed the noise, but a single record still carries it, and \
carries a specific one. Since ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["Q", "TI"], "-", 
   SqrtBox[
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], " ", 
   StyleBox["z", "TI"], " ", 
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["t", "TI"], "=", 
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["W", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "16b44e14-0404-e868-3e4c-605eadb6bab2"],
 " exactly, subtracting the integrated signal from one record must return the \
very Wiener path that drove the state. Build one trajectory, strip its \
signal, and overlay the remainder on its driving path ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["W", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "70bc3c38-1a7f-2cd8-2043-b6629f0a7622"],
 ":"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7e10bd94-ae42-3b4d-262f-34d1cbf48997"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"With", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"r", " ", "=", " ", "ratesB"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"dt", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"dtGenOf", "[", "ratesB", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"seed", " ", "=", " ", "7"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{"With", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Wf", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"wienerFun", "[", 
         RowBox[{"tfB", ",", " ", "dt", ",", " ", "seed"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"traj", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"oneTraj", "[", 
         RowBox[{
         "r", ",", " ", "initB", ",", " ", "tfB", ",", " ", "dt", ",", " ", 
          "seed", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"dt", "/", "4"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"u", ",", " ", "t", ",", " ", "zint"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", 
       "   ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"zint", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"NDSolveValue", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"u", "'"}], "[", "t", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"traj", "[", 
                RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}], "[", "t", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"u", "[", "0", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", "0."}]}], "}"}], ",",
            " ", "u", ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"t", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "tfB"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";",
         "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{"Plot", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"traj", "[", 
               RowBox[{"[", "4", "]"}], "]"}], "[", "t", "]"}], " ", "-", " ", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
               RowBox[{"r", "[", 
                RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", 
              RowBox[{"zint", "[", "t", "]"}]}]}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"Wf", "[", "t", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"t", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "tfB"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", 
          "    ", 
          RowBox[{"PlotStyle", " ", "->", " ", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"Thick", ",", " ", "Dashed"}], "}"}]}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
          RowBox[{"PlotLegends", " ", "->", " ", 
           RowBox[{"Placed", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"{", 
              
              RowBox[{"\"\<record minus signal: Q(t) - \!\(\*SqrtBox[\(\
\[CapitalGamma]CI\)]\) \[Integral]z dt\>\"", ",", 
               " ", "\"\<driving path W(t)\>\""}], "}"}], ",", " ", "Below"}],
             "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
          RowBox[{"Frame", " ", "->", " ", "True"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"GridLines", " ", "->", " ", "Automatic"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"FrameLabel", " ", "->", " ", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<t\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<W\>\""}], "}"}]}], ",", "\n", 
          "    ", 
          RowBox[{
          "PlotLabel", " ", "->", 
           " ", "\"\<stripping the signal from the record returns the driving \
noise\>\""}]}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[43]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"5fdf5ac0-01aa-1326-05e5-53aab05f7e0c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Notice that the stripped record lands on the driving path to the width of \
the line. This is the physical content of a measurement made literal: the \
fluctuations in the record are not merely correlated with the noise that \
kicked the state, they are that noise. The observer reads ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SqrtBox[
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], 
   StyleBox["\[Integral]",
    FontSize->1.15 Inherited], 
   StyleBox["z", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "013c2307-fb8b-27c7-30c3-bb60fe3f8d2d"],
 " as signal; the remainder is the single innovation ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox[
   RowBox[{"d", "W"}], "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4b734859-75e7-efa6-7901-62030393b58c"],
 " the detector wrote into the record and the backaction at once."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4ae31c17-eefa-a706-7a90-96508a8c0a6c"],

Cell["\<\
Rather than trust the line width, put a number on it, the largest gap between \
the stripped record and the driving path across the window; define the \
residual once, its solver goals adjustable, and read it at the default \
tolerance:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"00844d77-2817-3ec6-30bc-653149a3842c"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "recordResidual", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"recordResidual", "[", "goal_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"With", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"r", " ", "=", " ", "ratesB"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"dt", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"dtGenOf", "[", "ratesB", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"seed", " ", "=", " ", "7"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"With", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Wf", " ", "=", " ", 
          RowBox[{"wienerFun", "[", 
           RowBox[{"tfB", ",", " ", "dt", ",", " ", "seed"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
         " ", 
         RowBox[{"traj", " ", "=", " ", 
          RowBox[{"oneTraj", "[", 
           RowBox[{
           "r", ",", " ", "initB", ",", " ", "tfB", ",", " ", "dt", ",", " ", 
            "seed", ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"dt", "/", "4"}], ",", " ", "goal"}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}], ",",
        "\n", "    ", 
       RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"u", ",", " ", "t", ",", " ", "zint"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", 
         "     ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"zint", " ", "=", " ", 
           RowBox[{"NDSolveValue", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"u", "'"}], "[", "t", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"traj", "[", 
                  RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}], "[", "t", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"u", "[", "0", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", "0."}]}], "}"}],
              ",", " ", "u", ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"t", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "tfB"}], "}"}], ",", "\n",
              "       ", 
             RowBox[{"AccuracyGoal", " ", "->", " ", "goal"}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"PrecisionGoal", " ", "->", " ", "goal"}]}], "]"}]}], ";",
           "\n", "     ", 
          RowBox[{"With", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"s", " ", "=", " ", 
              RowBox[{"Subdivide", "[", 
               RowBox[{"0.", ",", " ", "tfB", ",", " ", "1000"}], "]"}]}], 
             "}"}], ",", "\n", "      ", 
            RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
             RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"traj", "[", 
                 RowBox[{"[", "4", "]"}], "]"}], "[", "s", "]"}], " ", "-", 
               " ", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
                 RowBox[{"r", "[", 
                  RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", 
                RowBox[{"zint", "[", "s", "]"}]}], " ", "-", " ", 
               RowBox[{"Wf", "[", "s", "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}], 
        "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"recordResidual", "[", "Automatic", "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[44]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"20b97f64-b973-0c8a-5047-774e380656d0"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The same ODE defines ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["Q", "TI"], "\[Prime]"], "=", 
   SqrtBox[
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], 
   StyleBox["z", "TI"], "+", 
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["W", "TI"], "\[Prime]"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "04469009-6b02-dcc3-2c7d-0a530eb4a629"],
 ", so this is a self-consistency check, not an independent validation of the \
route. Its residual combines the numerical errors of the four-component solve \
and the auxiliary integral. Rerun the same trajectory with tighter goals:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4e35d333-5bd5-ef26-77ca-cb7d5e61b20c"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"recordResidual", "[", "10", "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[45]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"5547dfb6-0e84-e145-037c-d6f0ab36b3af"],

Cell["\<\
The residual decreases when the requested goals are tightened, as expected \
for integration error. The exact regularized ODE satisfies the identity; the \
reported nonzero residual is numerical.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"12b61bfc-9cd7-eca9-424d-92a61563b6f3"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "One regime makes the tie between the monitored population and its record \
explicit. Switch off relaxation and drive, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], "1"], "=", 
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalOmega]", 
    StyleBox["x", "TI"]], "=", "0"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "451364b5-819d-fb99-7321-7dff3029c9e3"],
 ". Phase backaction and transverse dephasing still affect ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["x", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "13b49e24-0fb7-4441-414b-178eaa422eab"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["y", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "445bf28f-7a5a-ecd1-6c78-ebe97fecb63b"],
 ", but not ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["z", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "089aa42d-ce49-3603-38b9-3e76ebfd9d69"],
 ". Dividing the Stratonovich ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["z", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "48fccab3-b886-a0f7-7883-e3fd3930f2dd"],
 " row by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"1", "-", 
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["z", "TI"], "2"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0cdaad60-2181-5e26-34f9-454a5034250c"],
 " and using the ordinary chain rule gives ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], " ", 
   StyleBox["arctanh",
    FontSlant->"Plain"], " ", 
   StyleBox["z", "TI"], "=", 
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
    StyleBox[
     RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]], 
   StyleBox["z", "TI"], " ", 
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["t", "TI"], "+", 
   SqrtBox[
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], " ", 
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["W", "TI"], "=", 
   SqrtBox[
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], " ", 
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["Q", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "542cff75-84e0-b601-7dd3-f73f2c9a1d6b"],
 ". Therefore"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"00dd9d4d-f7ec-565f-30e2-151681993ca5"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["z", "TI"], 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["(",
      SpanMaxSize->1], 
     StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
     StyleBox[")",
      SpanMaxSize->1]}]}], "=", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["tanh",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[ThinSpace]", "\[NegativeThinSpace]", 
